yrkt/univet_mg/commit/44d8740e59a234a8e2f704120483dac8776f3e20","node_id":"C_kwDOUCrVYNoAKDQ0ZDg3NDBlNTlhMjM0YThlMmY3MDQxMjA0ODNkYWM4Nzc2ZjNlMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Andryrkt/univet_mg/commit/5eb1454c8e8b3094baf8311ce8f02389a487e3b8","sha":"5eb1454c8e8b3094baf8311ce8f02389a487e3b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Andryrkt/univet_mg/commits/5eb1454c8e8b3094baf8311ce8f02389a487e3b8"}],"sha":"44d8740e59a234a8e2f704120483dac8776f3e20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Andryrkt/univet_mg/commits/44d8740e59a234a8e2f704120483dac8776f3e20"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72664121?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Andryrkt","id":72664121,"login":"Andryrkt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNjY0MTIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Andryrkt/univet_mg/commits/5eb1454c8e8b3094baf8311ce8f02389a487e3b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T06:43:51Z","email":"andryrkt08@gmail.com","name":"Andryrkt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T06:43:51Z","email":"andryrkt08@gmail.com","name":"Andryrkt"},"message":"Créer automatiquement le compte admin en production\n\nLe job \"migrate\" n''exécutait que les migrations Prisma, jamais de seed\n(volontairement, pour ne pas polluer la prod avec les données de démo du\nseed complet). Résultat : aucun compte admin n''existait après le premier\ndéploiement, empêchant toute connexion.\n\nAjoute un script dédié (create-admin.ts) qui ne crée que le compte admin\nvia SEED_ADMIN_EMAIL/SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD, idempotent, exécuté après\n`prisma migrate deploy` à chaque déploiement.","tree":{"sha":"f52b540512dd8f7e8f0efbbbbd782418e39b56bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Andryrkt/univet_mg/git/trees/f52b540512dd8f7e8f0efbbbbd782418e39b56bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Andryrkt/univet_mg/git/commits/5eb1454c8e8b3094baf8311ce8f02389a487e3b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72664121?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Andryrkt","id":72664121,"login":"Andryrkt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNjY0MTIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andryrkt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Andryrkt/univet_mg/commit/5eb1454c8e8b3094baf8311ce8f02389a487e3b8","node_id":"C_kwDOUCrVYNoAKDVlYjE0NTRjOGU4YjMwOTRiYWY4MzExY2U4ZjAyMzg5YTQ4N2UzYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Andryrkt/univet_mg/commit/9ec1ddc797e51b526bbeeb53a5e5b467a5d3332d","sha":"9ec1dd