iro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adao00ribeiro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adao00ribeiro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adao00ribeiro","id":22963249,"login":"adao00ribeiro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTYzMjQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adao00ribeiro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adao00ribeiro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adao00ribeiro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adao00ribeiro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adao00ribeiro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adao00ribeiro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adao00ribeiro/EnergySuite/commits/74d04b4a683b85edcb9c8652fb802fa77dd9937c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T01:35:09Z","email":"adao-eduardo@hotmail.com","name":"Adão Eduardo Ribeiro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T01:35:09Z","email":"adao-eduardo@hotmail.com","name":"Adão Eduardo Ribeiro"},"message":"feat: Implement Hydrological Simulation Progress Consumer and SignalR Integration\n\n- Added HydrologicalSimulationProgressConsumer to handle simulation progress events and notify clients via SignalR.\n- Created EtrmHub for managing SignalR connections and tenant group subscriptions.\n- Introduced RiskController with endpoint for calculating Mark-to-Market (MtM) for contract positions.\n- Developed CalculateMarkToMarketCommand and its handler for processing MtM calculations, including fallback logic.\n- Implemented integration events for HydrologicalSimulationProgressEvent.\n- Added official parsers for ONS/CCEE sector files (DADVAZ, PREVS, VNA) with corresponding tests.\n- Enhanced frontend SignalR service to manage simulation progress updates and display in the reservoir levels chart.","tree":{"sha":"bb9a1912