os 4 MFEs\n  compuestos a la vez, no solo al header). semantic.css gana el bloque\n  [data-theme=''dark''] con los mismos tokens, apuntando a otros primitivos.\n- Store gana imageUrl (Store en shared-catalog, mocks de mock-api y de los specs que\n  construían el tipo a mano) — StoresPage ya la muestra.\n- MiniCart: ícono de carrito además del texto de items/total.\n- Footer: contacto (correo y celular).\n- body pasa de un color plano a un degradado sutil hacia los primitivos verde/ámbar\n  (antes duplicado en el styles.scss de cada app, ahora centralizado en\n  design-tokens/src/base.css).\n- ThanksPage: confeti CSS muy tenue (opacidad baja, ~3s) al confirmar un pedido, solo\n  para reforzar \"esto se procesó\" sin ser intrusivo.","tree":{"sha":"1ae4f70a56ad92b95a45eeb6a2513bcef8bf3b0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/trees/1ae4f70a56ad92b95a45eeb6a2513bcef8bf3b0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/commits/05605260ed50b117cae31ca11b1091b3bd83de19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186736090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndresT309","id":186736090,"login":"AndresT309","node_id":"U_kgDOCyFd2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user