AndresT309"},"message":"fix(estilos): incluir el código de los 4 apps en el content de Tailwind de cada una\n\nCada app generaba su CSS escaneando solo su propio código fuente. En producción, el\nshell compone las rutas de los 3 MFEs en el navegador vía Module Federation, pero solo\nenlaza su propio CSS — nadie carga la hoja de estilos de un remoto compuesto. El\nresultado: clases de Tailwind usadas en un MFE (por ejemplo aspect-video/object-cover\ndel teaser de mfe-explore) quedaban purgadas del único CSS que realmente se sirve al\ncomponer todo, dejando el layout sin esos estilos aunque los componentes con Shadow DOM\n(como los botones) se vieran bien.\n\nLas 4 apps ahora comparten el mismo content (las 4 más ts-design-system), así el CSS\nde cualquiera de ellas trae el superset completo de clases que puede necesitar\ncualquier combinación compuesta. Verificado generando el build de producción del shell\ny confirmando que su CSS final ya incluye las clases que antes faltaban.","tree":{"sha":"2412bc4739277cc7bbdabb95274335ea7e7c745e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/trees/2412bc4739277cc7bbdabb95274335ea7e7c745e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/commits/24faa7fc5e27b539a6d8a704ada693f0800765f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186736090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndresT309","id":186736090,"login":"AndresT309","node_id":"U_kgDOCyFd2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commit/24faa7fc5e27b539a6d8a704ada693f0800765f1","node_id":"C_kwDOUCyyM9oAKDI0ZmFhN2ZjNWUyN2I1MzlhNmQ4YTcwNGFkYTY5M2YwODAwNzY1ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commit/edaa0982650bc4803f8fb24d50b9beb6e0d565f2","sha":"edaa0982650bc4803f8fb24d50b9beb6e0d565f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commits/edaa0982650bc4803f8fb24d50b9beb6e0d565f2"}],"sha":"24faa7fc5e27b539a6d8a704ada693f0800765f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commits/24faa7fc5e27b539a6d8a704ada693f0800765f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186736090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndresT309","id":186736090,"login":"AndresT309","node_id":"U_kgDOCyFd2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commits/edaa0982650bc4803f8fb24d50b9beb6e0d565f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:56:27Z","email":"darwin.tangarife@quind.io","name":"AndresT309"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:56:27Z","email":"darwin.tangarife@quind.io","name":"AndresT309"},"message":"fix(federation): proveer la URL de la API desde el shell, no desde cada MFE\n\nBug real encontrado probando el despliegue en Railway: el bootstrap.ts de cada MFE\n(donde antes se sobreescribía el token de API_URL con el valor de runtime-config.json)\nsolo corre cuando ese MFE arranca standalone en su propia URL. Cuando el shell compone\nsus rutas vía Module Federation — el flujo real de la tienda — ese bootstrap.ts nunca\nse ejecuta, así que las llamadas HTTP seguían cayendo al default de desarrollo local\n(http://localhost:8080/api) sin importar qué dijera runtime-config.json de cada MFE.\n\nSe centralizan los tres tokens (EXPLORE_API_URL/DECIDE_API_URL/CHECKOUT_API_URL, que de\ntodas formas apuntaban al mismo backend) en un único API_URL en shared-catalog, y es el\nbootstrap.ts del shell — el único que realmente arranca la aplicación Angular cuando\ntodo está compuesto — quien ahora lo sobreescribe desde su propio runtime-config.json.\nVerificado en vivo con Playwright contra los 4 contenedores Docker reales, cada uno con\nun API_URL distinto y detectable: las peticiones HTTP de servicios de MFEs compuestos\nusan el valor del shell, no el suyo propio ni el default.\n\nDe paso, deploy/docker-entrypoint.sh había quedado con terminadores CRLF (por un\ncheckout en Windows durante la reparación del incidente de Dependabot), lo que rompía\nel contenedor al arrancar (\"exec: no such file or directory\", engañoso — el problema\nreal es el \\r del shebang). Se agrega .gitattributes para que esto no vuelva a pasar.","tree":{"sha":"e566dc0735b27b9c15e1345f10a8cad67c20e2a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/trees/e566dc0735b27b9c15e1345f10a8cad67c20e2a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/commits/edaa0982650bc4803f8fb24d50b9beb6e0d565f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186736090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndresT309","id":186736090,"login":"AndresT309","node_id":"U_kgDOCyFd2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commit/edaa0982650bc4803f8fb24d50b9beb6e0d565f2","node_id":"C_kwDOUCyyM9oAKGVkYWEwOTgyNjUwYmM0ODAzZjhmYjI0ZDUwYjliZWI2ZTBkNTY1ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commit/3d0e13273b6e32a333aba68161c2d969c275c373","sha":"3d0e13273b6e32a333aba68161c2d969c275c373","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commits/3d0e13273b6e32a333aba68161c2d969c275c373"}],"sha":"edaa0982650bc4803f8fb24d50b9beb6e0d565f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commits/edaa0982650bc4803f8fb24d50b9beb6e0d565f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186736090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndresT309","id":186736090,"login":"AndresT309","node_id":"U_kgDOCyFd2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commits/3d0e13273b6e32a333aba68161c2d969c275c373/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T16:28:19Z","email":"darwin.tangarife@quind.io","name":"AndresT309"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T16:28:19Z","email":"darwin.tangarife@quind.io","name":"AndresT309"},"message":"chore(ci): disparar un push para refrescar los checks disponibles en el ruleset\n\nCommit vacío, sin cambios de código: GitHub solo ofrece como seleccionables en\nRulesets los checks que corrieron directamente contra la rama protegida.","tree":{"sha":"62d11d50bd37712e2905534286c3478500068ba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/trees/62d11d50bd37712e2905534286c3478500068ba0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/commits/3d0e13273b6e32a333aba68161c2d969c275c373","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co