/users/AndresT309/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresT309","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/commits/a7847ef3b6661f77eef2312c228f1283cb5da343/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:38:32Z","email":"darwin.tangarife@quind.io","name":"AndresT309"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:38:32Z","email":"darwin.tangarife@quind.io","name":"AndresT309"},"message":"fix(ci): corregir Node en sonarcloud.yml y endurecer Dependabot tras la cascada de merges\n\npnpm 11.24.0 necesita Node >=22.13 (usa node:sqlite) — sonarcloud.yml seguía en Node\n20, mismo bug ya resuelto antes en los Dockerfiles pero que aquí quedó sin corregir.\n\nSe quita el agrupamiento de Angular/Nx en Dependabot: dependabot/fetch-metadata no\nexpone un update-type confiable para PRs agrupados, y eso dejó pasar un bump major de\nNx (20 a 23, incompatible con Angular 19.2 fijado en este proyecto) por el auto-merge\nsin que nadie lo revisara — main llegó a tener un lockfile roto por el propio caos de\nmerges concurrentes. Se agrega ignore explícito para majors de Angular/Nx además de\nseparar los PRs.","tree":{"sha":"8e4a0e9b74ee2f42a842cefab913282caa583dd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/trees/8e4a0e9b74ee2f42a842cefab913282caa583dd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AndresT3009/tractor-store-frontend/git/commits/a7847ef3b6661f77eef2312c228f1283cb5da343","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1867