880px).","tree":{"sha":"5c2dcc700cb27a4c80eda58b7fbd7877f6614bd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/5c2dcc700cb27a4c80eda58b7fbd7877f6614bd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/da3d195d8212d55e7e1974ff4dc19f6789558ab5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/da3d195d8212d55e7e1974ff4dc19f6789558ab5","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKGRhM2QxOTVkODIxMmQ1NWU3ZTE5NzRmZjRkYzE5ZjY3ODk1NThhYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/b88750f99ccc660d3f2247e940097c22496bc218","sha":"b88750f99ccc660d3f2247e940097c22496bc218","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/b88750f99ccc660d3f2247e940097c22496bc218"}],"sha":"da3d195d8212d55e7e1974ff4dc19f6789558ab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/da3d195d8212d55e7e1974ff4dc19f6789558ab5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/b88750f99ccc660d3f2247e940097c22496bc218/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:52:13Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.local","name":"FreeGraduates"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:52:13Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.local","name":"FreeGraduates"},"message":"chore(deploy): production docker stack + smoke test + docs\n\n- docker-compose.yml: orchestrates backend (FastAPI on :8000) and\n  frontend (nginx on :8080) with healthchecks, persistent\n  backend-data volume, and Firebase service-account bind-mount\n- Makefile: dev convenience targets (up, down, logs, smoke, health,\n  build, clean, help)\n- frontend/Dockerfile: multi-stage Vite build -> nginx:1.27-alpine\n- frontend/nginx.conf: SPA fallback + /api/* reverse proxy + caching\n  + security headers + /healthz probe endpoint\n- frontend/.dockerignore, backend/.dockerignore: trimmed build context\n- backend/.gitignore: also ignore the new coach / cover-letter /\n  optimization / resume data dirs (were untracked before)\n- backend/app/data/{coach,cover_letter,optimizations,resumes}/.gitkeep\n  placeholder files so the per-user storage layout ships in git\n- scripts/smoke_backend.py: end-to-end backend smoke test that drives\n  every primary endpoint (health, profile, resume, optimizer, coach,\n  cover letter) and asserts the expected status codes\n- docs/DEPLOYMENT.md: full production deployment guide covering\n  Caddy/Nginx/PaaS reverse-proxy setups, backups, operational\n  health checks, security checklist, troubleshooting\n- README.md: rewritten with Docker quickstart, dev quickstart,\n  project structure, full env-var tables, smoke-test instructions\n- backend/README.md: full endpoint catalogue for commits 1-7\n- backend/app/storage.py: fix `list_resumes` globbing profile.json\n  (which has no `id` field and crashed the summary build). Now\n  scoped to resume-*.json. Required so the smoke test could run\n  end-to-end against the new profile endpoint.","tree":{"sha":"9b2e652aae67aa59aaf8c1b254c0536daec34a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/9b2e652aae67aa59aaf8c1b254c0536daec34a8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/b88750f99ccc660d3f2247e940097c22496bc218","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/b88750f99ccc660d3f2247e940097c22496bc218","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKGI4ODc1MGY5OWNjYzY2MGQzZjIyNDdlOTQwMDk3YzIyNDk2YmMyMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/05a3863447996f3ab028a4431733f9784a865b73","sha":"05a3863447996f3ab028a4431733f9784a865b73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/05a3863447996f3ab028a4431733f9784a865b73"}],"sha":"b88750f99ccc660d3f2247e940097c22496bc218","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/b88750f99ccc660d3f2247e940097c22496bc218"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/05a3863447996f3ab028a4431733f9784a865b73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:35:16Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.local","name":"FreeGraduates"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:35:16Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.local","name":"FreeGraduates"},"message":"feat(cover-letter): JD-tailored cover letter generator with editing\n\n- backend: new app/services/cover_letter package with truth-constrained\n  generator (Gemini path with rules fallback) and per-user JSON storage\n  under data/cover_letter/<uid>/<letter_id>.json\n- backend: 6 new endpoints under /api/cover-letter (create, list, get,\n  update, regenerate, delete) wired into main.py\n- backend: CoverLetterCreate / CoverLetterUpdate / CoverLetter Pydantic\n  models in models.py\n- frontend: coverLetterApi in api.js, new CoverLetterView component\n  (list view + form + 2-column editor with subject + body, regenerate\n  with tone/length overrides, copy-to-clipboard, mark-final, delete)\n- frontend: /cover-letter protected route in App.jsx and Sidebar entry\n\nSmoke-tested end-to-end with DEV_AUTH_BYPASS: save resume -> create\nletter (rules path, 141 words) -> list -> get -> update subject/status\n-> regenerate with concise/short -> delete. Negative cases (422 missing\nresumeId, 404 not found) confirmed. npm run build passes.","tree":{"sha":"7e380b436114b3ac8a4942018903fdaefd443f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/7e380b436114b3ac8a4942018903fdaefd443f08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/05a3863447996f3ab028a4431733f9784a865b73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_ur