Kenguri"},"message":"feat(coach): JD-driven interview-question generator with answer tracking\n\n- backend/app/services/coach/questions.py: rule-based generator (behavioral/technical/resume/role) with optional Gemini fallback via llm.get_llm().chat_json()\n\n- backend/app/services/coach/storage.py: per-user JSON storage under settings.data_dir/coach/<uid>/\n\n- backend/app/api/routes_coach.py: POST/GET list/GET one/POST regenerate/PUT answer/DELETE endpoints under /api/coach\n\n- backend/app/models.py: CoachQuestion, CoachAnswer, CoachSessionCreate, CoachAnswerUpdate, CoachSession schemas\n\n- backend/main.py: register coach_router\n\n- frontend/src/api/api.js: coachApi with list/create/get/regenerate/saveAnswer/remove\n\n- frontend/src/components/CoachView.jsx + .css: list of sessions, new-session form (JD + optional resume/role/company/n), per-question textarea with auto-save on blur, model-answer/tip reveal, progress bar, regenerate + delete\n\n- frontend/src/App.jsx: replace coach placeholder with CoachView; add /coach route","tree":{"sha":"24bd3c6d74457d3e708276c5e4b747f9d1e0cf50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/24bd3c6d74457d3e708276c5e4b747f9d1e0cf50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/f4bb7c167ad60a7c35f3d272b7e835b6085529f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266463060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9","id":266463060,"login":"Nikhilsai-9","node_id":"U_kgDOD-HnVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/f4bb7c167ad60a7c35f3d272b7e835b6085529f4","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKGY0YmI3YzE2N2FkNjBhN2MzNWYzZDI3MmI3ZTgzNWI2MDg1NTI5ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/8227def9af317c7507f9c62517f8d3fb5684ae64","sha":"8227def9af317c7507f9c62517f8d3fb5684ae64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/8227def9af317c7507f9c62517f8d3fb5684ae64"}],"sha":"f4bb7c167ad60a7c35f3d272b7e835b6085529f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/f4bb7c167ad60a7c35f3d272b7e835b6085529f4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/8227def9af317c7507f9c62517f8d3fb5684ae64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:51:24Z","email":"agent@freegraduates.local","name":"Build Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:51:24Z","email":"agent@freegraduates.local","name":"Build Agent"},"message":"feat(optimizer): JD-driven resume tailor with LLM fallback + storage\n\nAdds the Optimizer product surface: a parallel workflow to the Builder that takes a saved resume + a JD, scores the match, surfaces gaps, and rewrites the candidate.\n\nBackend:\n\n- app/services/optimizer/tailor.py: tailor_resume() with optional Gemini call, deterministic rules fallback, TailoringResult dataclass (candidate + changesApplied + generatedBy).\n\n- app/services/optimizer/storage.py: per-user JSON storage (OptimizerStorage) keyed by uid under app/data/optimizer/<uid>/<id>.json.\n\n- app/api/routes_optimizer.py: full REST surface - create, list, get, delete, analyze, tailor, update. Wires analyze_job_description + score_resume_against_jd + tailor_resume + storage.\n\n- main.py: optimizer_router registered alongside health/profile/resume routers.\n\nFrontend:\n\n- src/api/api.js: optimizerApi (list/create/get/analyze/tailor/remove).\n\n- src/components/OptimizerView.jsx + .css: dedicated view with list of saved optimizations, new-optimization form (base resume + JD + optional role/company), match-score card, gap chips, tailored-candidate diff.\n\n- src/App.jsx: /optimizer routes to OptimizerView.\n\nSmoke tested end-to-end (DEV_AUTH_BYPASS): save resume -> create opt -> analyze (score 44, status=analyzing) -> tailor (3 changesApplied, generatedBy=rules fallback when no Gemini key).","tree":{"sha":"d4c0ae4adb20d60a43e38ed48742a7945a25d8ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/d4c0ae4adb20d60a43e38ed48742a7945a25d8ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/8227def9af317c7507f9c62517f8d3fb5684ae64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/8227def9af317c7507f9c62517f8d3fb5684ae64","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDgyMjdkZWY5YWYzMTdjNzUwN2Y5YzYyNTE3ZjhkM2ZiNTY4NGFlNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/379d463b4ec93b606d3fd1eb05bb8d46a2f52753","sha":"379d463b4ec93b606d3fd1eb05bb8d46a2f52753","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/379d463b4ec93b606d3fd1eb05bb8d46a2f52753"}],"sha":"8227def9af317c7507f9c62517f8d3fb5684ae64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/8227def9af317c7507f9c62517f8d3fb5684ae64"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/379d463b4ec93b606d3fd1eb05bb8d46a2f52753/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:34:31Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.com","name":"FreeGraduates"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:34:31Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.com","name":"FreeGraduates"},"message":"feat(ats): dedicated ATS-compliance scanner view + service\n\nThe Sidebar linked /ats-scanner to the same view as /analyzer, even\nthough ATS scoring is a different question (format/structure, not\ncontent). This commit adds a real backend scanner and a dedicated\nview that surfaces the result as a visual rubric.\n\nBackend:\n- new app/services/ats.py with rule-based checklist:\n  contact info completeness, summary presence/length, experience\n  header completeness, action-verb + metric density, education,\n  skills coverage, total bullet density. Same input -> same score.\n- app/models.py: AtsCheckRequest / AtsCheckResponse / AtsCheckItem\n- app/api/routes_resume.py: new POST /api/resume/ats-check\n- Weighted scoring: pass = full weight, warn = half, fail = 0;\n  verdict bucketed as ats-ready / minor-fixes / needs-work\n\nFrontend:\n- api.js: resumeApi.atsCheck({ candidate })\n- new components/AtsScannerView.jsx + .css\n  - summary card with circular score, verdict pill, pass/warn/fail\n    counters\n  - responsive grid of check cards (pass/warn/fail affordances,\n    per-check detail + one-line fix)\n  - empty state when user has no saved resume yet\n  - re-check button + Toast on API errors\n- App.jsx routes /ats-scanner to AtsScannerView; analyzer + optimizer\n  still share ResumeAnalyzerView\n\nVerified:\n- python -m py_compile passes for all edited backend files\n- POST /api/resume/ats-check smoke test:\n  empty  -> 4.5, needs-work, 0/2/7\n  strong -> 94.4, ats-ready, 10/1/0\n- npm run build passes (warning only)","tree":{"sha":"24b99101662f37c68b428773b58cbf8f37b94936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/24b99101662f37c68b428773b58cbf8f37b94936"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/379d463b4ec93b606d3fd1eb05bb8d46a2f52753","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/379d463b4ec93b606d3fd1eb05bb8d46a2f52753","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDM3OWQ0NjNiNGVjOTNiNjA2ZDNmZDFlYjA1YmI4ZDQ2YTJmNTI3NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/75740173bd9c19bd02e82ef7c2ddc080bcb6b1cd","sha":"75740173bd9c19bd02e82ef7c2ddc080bcb6b1cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/75740173bd9c19bd02e82ef7c2ddc080bcb6b1cd"}],"sha":"379d463b4ec93b606d3fd1eb05bb8d46a2f52753","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/379d463b4ec93b606d3fd1eb05bb8d46a2f52753"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/75740173bd9c19bd02e82ef7c2ddc080bcb6b1cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:29:21Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.com","name":"FreeGraduates"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:29:21Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.com","name":"FreeGraduates"},"message":"feat(analyzer): real resume-vs-JD analyzer service\n\nThe Analyzer view used to call a frontend-only heuristic in\n`services/aiEngine.generateResumeDiffAnalysis` and never hit the\nbackend. This commit moves scoring and diff generation server-side\nso every analysis is reproducible, auditable, and shared across\ndevices.\n\nBackend:\n- new `app/services/analyzer.py`:\n  - transparent weighted score (55% keyword / 15% verbs / 15%\n    metrics / 10% completeness / 5% summary)\n  - rule-based suggestion builders (summary keywords, skills\n    additions, active-verb upgrade, metric injection, education\n    prompt) -- no LLM in the scoring loop, so the same input\n    always yields the same number\n  - dataclass `_Scores` keeps the formula readable\n- `app/models.py`: new `AnalyzeRequest`, `AnalyzeResponse`,\n  `AnalyzeSuggestion`, `AnalyzeScoreBreakdown` Pydantic models\n- `app/api/routes_resume.py`: new `POST /api/resume/analyze`\n  endpoint, returns `AnalyzeResponse`\n\nFrontend:\n- `api.js`: `resumeApi.analyze({ candidate, job })` wrapper\n- `ResumeAnalyzerView.jsx`:\n  - drops `generateResumeDiffAnalysis` and calls the backend\n  - best-effort prefill from the user''\\''''s most-recent saved\n    resume so the editor reflects their real data\n  - toasts API failures, keeps the diff UI intact\n  - empty placeholder result instead of fabricated numbers on\n    first load\n\nVerified:\n- `python -m py_compile` passes for all edited backend files\n- `POST /api/resume/analyze` returns sensible scores across\n  three smoke tests:\n  empty candidate -> 7.5 (poor)\n  strong candidate -> 84.5 (strong, 90.9% keywords, 100% verbs)\n  candidate with no JD -> 38.3 (completeness-only path)\n- `npm run build` passes (warning only)","tree":{"sha":"15dd97f80b2768be4e55d362116057a75ef07fcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/15dd97f80b2768be4e55d362116057a75ef07fcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/75740173bd9c19bd02e82ef7c2ddc080bcb6b1cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/75740173bd9c19bd02e82ef7c2ddc080bcb6b1cd","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDc1NzQwMTczYmQ5YzE5YmQwMmU4MmVmN2MyZGRjMDgwYmNiNmIxY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/dc3c04e72c0476d35863a9df9e46d91253a2c074","sha":"dc3c04e72c0476d35863a9df9e46d91253a2c074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/dc3c04e72c0476d35863a9df9e46d91253a2c074"}],"sha":"75740173bd9c19bd02e82ef7c2ddc080bcb6b1cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/75740173bd9c19bd02e82ef7c2ddc080bcb6b1cd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/dc3c04e72c0476d35863a9df9e46d91253a2c074/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:22:51Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.com","name":"FreeGraduates"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:22:51Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.com","name":"FreeGraduates"},"message":"feat(workspace): My Resumes workspace with Builder round-trip\n\n- History.jsx fully rewritten as a saved-resumes workspace\n  backed by GET/DELETE /api/resume/*.\n  - 3-column action card: Open, Export (DOCX/PDF/MD), Delete.\n  - Search box (name/role/company).\n  - Empty state with CTA to /builder/new.\n  - Result-count + last-edited meta in the header.\n- History.css extended with history-card-badges, history-search-row,\n  history-header-actions, badge-neutral, export-menu, btn-danger,\n  btn-sm utility styles.\n- ResumeBuilderView entry step:\n  - \"View all saved resumes\" link next to the saved-list title.\n  - Inline list capped at 4 to keep the entry step tidy.\n  - When 0 saved resumes, a single CTA to /history is shown.\n  - Adds `Link` import + `History` icon import.\n- npm run build passes (warning only -- chunk size).\n- POST /api/resume/save + GET /api/resume/list round-trip\n  verified under DEV_AUTH_BYPASS for a fresh user.","tree":{"sha":"e215b68af24a0930b1a6c2bda30903aca9818848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/e215b68af24a0930b1a6c2bda30903aca9818848"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/dc3c04e72c0476d35863a9df9e46d91253a2c074","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/dc3c04e72c0476d35863a9df9e46d91253a2c074","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKGRjM2MwNGU3MmMwNDc2ZDM1ODYzYTlkZjllNDZkOTEyNTNhMmMwNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/5ea5200c8395fbb080e3a18718704344be01c55b","sha":"5ea5200c8395fbb080e3a18718704344be01c55b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/5ea5200c8395fbb080e3a18718704344be01c55b"}],"sha":"dc3c04e72c0476d35863a9df9e46d91253a2c074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/dc3c04e72c0476d35863a9df9e46d91253a2c074"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/5ea5200c8395fbb080e3a18718704344be01c55b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:15:06Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.com","name":"FreeGraduates"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:15:06Z","email":"dev@freegraduates.com","name":"FreeGraduates"},"message":"feat(profile): add authenticated profile API and onboarding wizard\n\nBackend:\n- new app/services/profile.py with Profile Pydantic model and\n  thread-safe ProfileStorage (per-uid JSON files under\n  data/users/<uid>/profile.json with atomic writes)\n- new app/api/routes_profile.py exposing GET /api/profile,\n  PUT /api/profile, POST /api/profile/onboard\n  (rejects userId spoofing, preserves unknown keys)\n- profile_router wired in main.py\n\nFrontend:\n- new pages/Onboarding.jsx -- 3-step wizard\n  (target role + education, skills + locations, confirmation)\n  with prefill from existing profile\n- new pages/Onboarding.css for wizard chrome\n- /onboarding route added to App.jsx as a protected full-screen\n  route (no sidebar)\n- api.js exposes profileApi.get / .save / .markOnboarded\n- Login.jsx and Signup.jsx route new users through /onboarding\n  when onboardingComplete is false\n\nVerified:\n- python -m py_compile passes for all edited backend files\n- uvicorn boots, GET /api/health returns 200, GET/PUT/POST\n  /api/profile and /api/profile/onboard round-trip cleanly\n  under DEV_AUTH_BYPASS (401 without it, as expected)\n- npm run build passes (warning only -- 500 kB chunk)","tree":{"sha":"1483e7308ca1924bd2854e18143ebcea946a7e65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/1483e7308ca1924bd2854e18143ebcea946a7e65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/5ea5200c8395fbb080e3a18718704344be01c55b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/5ea5200c8395fbb080e3a18718704344be01c55b","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDVlYTUyMDBjODM5NWZiYjA4MGUzYTE4NzE4NzA0MzQ0YmUwMWM1NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/dec04fcdef1ca233af55953bca8bdd5e6c1ccb7a","sha":"dec04fcdef1ca233af55953bca8bdd5e6c1ccb7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/dec04fcdef1ca233af55953bca8bdd5e6c1ccb7a"}],"sha":"5ea5200c8395fbb080e3a18718704344be01c55b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/5ea5200c8395fbb080e3a18718704344be01c55b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266463060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9","id":266463060,"login":"Nikhilsai-9","node_id":"U_kgDOD-HnVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/dec04fcdef1ca233af55953bca8bdd5e6c1ccb7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:37:52Z","email":"266463060+Nikhilsai-9@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nikhil Sai Kenguri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:37:52Z","email":"266463060+Nikhilsai-9@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nikhil Sai Kenguri"},"message":"feat: refactor authenticated app shell and routing\n\nRemoves the duplicate top header so the sidebar becomes the only chrome element, and makes the URL the single source of truth for the active workspace view.\n\nChanges:\n\n* Delete frontend/src/components/Header.jsx and its orphaned CSS (.unified-top-header, .header-*, .profile-menu-*, .avatar-circle, .hamburger-toggle-btn, .notif-*), plus frontend/src/pages/Dashboard.jsx and pages/Dashboard.css which had zero importers.\n\n* App.jsx — derive activeView from useLocation().pathname (viewFromPathname); builderOptions now reads resumeId from path and creationPath / templateStyle from ?path= / ?template= query params. Remove duplicate useState(activeView), removeHeader import + JSX, drop onBackToDashboard props.\n\n* Add ProtectedRoute routes for /analyzer, /ats-scanner, /optimizer, /coach, /history so every sidebar item reflects in the URL. /builder/new and /builder/:id still feed the ResumeBuilderView via the same AuthenticatedWorkspace.\n\n* Sidebar.jsx — URL-driven via useNavigate / useLocation; each nav item has an explicit path; active state derived from pathMatches; clicks call navigate() instead of setActiveView.\n\n* DashboardView.jsx — replaces setActiveView / onLaunchBuilder props with useNavigate() calls. Tool cards go to /analyzer, /ats-scanner, /optimizer; ''Upload Resume'' goes to /builder/new?path=upload; ''Create New'' goes to /builder/new; editing a saved resume goes to /builder/:id.\n\n* ResumeAnalyzerView.jsx — replaces onBackToDashboard prop with internal useNavigate() returning to /dashboard.\n\n* index.css (.pro-welcome-banner) — replace dark linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 55%, #0f2d5c 100%) with a flat surface using --color-paper, --color-border-subtle, --color-ink-primary tokens. Greys the previous white-only buttons and text so contrast holds on the light surface.\n\nVerification:\n\n* npm run build passes (vite v6.4.3, 1945 modules transformed).\n\n* python -m pytest from repo root: 110/110 tests pass.\n\n* No references to the deleted files remain anywhere in frontend/src.\n\n* Landing page (frontend/index.html, pages/Home.jsx, pages/Login.jsx, pages/Signup.jsx, pages/Onboarding.jsx, pages/Results.jsx, pages/History.jsx, pages/Builder.jsx and their CSS) is untouched. Phase 1 license-cleanup commit ea78af6 is preserved on origin/main.","tree":{"sha":"bf537e007f7b02d3405bd4e4c2d1c649b2a3dd8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/bf537e007f7b02d3405bd4e4c2d1c649b2a3dd8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/dec04fcdef1ca233af55953bca8bdd5e6c1ccb7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266463060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9","id":266463060,"login":"Nikhilsai-9","node_id":"U_kgDOD-HnVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/dec04fcdef1ca233af55953bca8bdd5e6c1ccb7a","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKGRlYzA0ZmNkZWYxY2EyMzNhZjU1OTUzYmNhOGJkZDVlNmMxY2NiN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/ea78af68b6d3b88f87019e90a1b57ad652e8f4ed","sha":"ea78af68b6d3b88f87019e90a1b57ad652e8f4ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/ea78af68b6d3b88f87019e90a1b57ad652e8f4ed"}],"sha":"dec04fcdef1ca233af55953bca8bdd5e6c1ccb7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/dec04fcdef1ca233af55953bca8bdd5e6c1ccb7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266463060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9","id":266463060,"login":"Nikhilsai-9","node_id":"U_kgDOD-HnVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/ea78af68b6d3b88f87019e90a1b57ad652e8f4ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:18:36Z","email":"266463060+Nikhilsai-9@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nikhil Sai Kenguri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:18:36Z","email":"266463060+Nikhilsai-9@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nikhil Sai Kenguri"},"message":"fix: remove incompatible resume rule dependency\n\nThe rule system under backend/app/data/rules/layer_*.md was byte-identical to the haderalva/ai-resume-builder repository (CC BY-NC 4.0), which is incompatible with the project''s MIT license. All four rule files have been rewritten as original FreeGraduates content with a distinct architecture:\n\n* Layer A — Truth & Source Authority (the non-negotiable constitution)\n\n* Layer B — Candidate Input Contract (schema tiers, seniority inference, length budgets, missing-field protocol)\n\n* Layer C — Structured Output & Presentation (canonical section order, Markdown conventions, ATS-safe rendering hooks)\n\n* Layer D — Validation & Recovery (QA checklist, auto-correction loop, deterministic fallback)\n\nAll haderalva / CC-BY-NC attribution has also been removed from:\n\n* backend/app/engine/rules_loader.py (module docstring)\n\n* backend/app/engine/schemas.py (module docstring)\n\n* backend/main.py (FastAPI description)\n\n* backend/LICENSE (replaced with MIT-consistent notice matching root)\n\n* backend/README.md (intro paragraph, attribution block, license section)\n\n* backend/app/services/optimizer/__init__.py (mis-attributed Layer A line removed)\n\n* backend/app/services/optimizer/ATTRIBUTION.md (mis-attributed Layer A bullet removed; replaced with clarification that fact-preservation rules are FreeGraduates-original)\n\nVerified: 110/110 existing tests pass; engine loads ~25KB of original rules via load_all_rules(); full-repo grep shows zero haderalva/CC-BY-NC references.","tree":{"sha":"d8580ce9afa3b16d298b73feada54dbfbea66f2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/d8580ce9afa3b16d298b73feada54dbfbea66f2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/ea78af68b6d3b88f87019e90a1b57ad652e8f4ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266463060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9","id":266463060,"login":"Nikhilsai-9","node_id":"U_kgDOD-HnVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/ea78af68b6d3b88f87019e90a1b57ad652e8f4ed","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKGVhNzhhZjY4YjZkM2I4OGY4NzAxOWU5MGExYjU3YWQ2NTJlOGY0ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/b512747e00ce95e11c92bacf3cb80b178d974803","sha":"b512747e00ce95e11c92bacf3cb80b178d974803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/b512747e00ce95e11c92bacf3cb80b178d974803"}],"sha":"ea78af68b6d3b88f87019e90a1b57ad652e8f4ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/ea78af68b6d3b88f87019e90a1b57ad652e8f4ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266463060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9","id":266463060,"login":"Nikhilsai-9","node_id":"U_kgDOD-HnVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/b512747e00ce95e11c92bacf3cb80b178d974803/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T08:16:29Z","email":"266463060+Nikhilsai-9@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nikhil Sai Kenguri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T08:16:29Z","email":"266463060+Nikhilsai-9@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nikhil Sai Kenguri"},"message":"fix: improve ATS skill matching and resume scoring\n\nRewrites the ATS / resume scoring engine to correctly judge whether a candidate actually has the skills a job description requires.\n\nHighlights:\n\n- Three-branch skill matching: (A) known technical keywords resolved against the resume keyword set; (B) bullet auto-passes when the requirement is purely soft/generic; (C) raw-text whole-word fallback for technical terms the keyword extractor does not recognise (e.g. Cobol, DB2, Fortran).\n\n- Whole-word matching with regex word boundaries prevents ``javascript`` from satisfying a ``java`` requirement, ``coboldians`` from satisfying ``cobol``, and ``NodeJS`` from satisfying ``Node.js``.\n\n- Generic-requirement filtering: common phrasing words (experience, knowledge, familiar, etc.) are stripped before scoring so they neither count as keywords nor as match candidates.\n\n- ATS bullet-density threshold lowered to >=2 bullets per job (was >=3) which is the realistic minimum for an entry-level role.\n\n- estimate_resume_years now (1) handles open-ended ``Present`` roles, (2) caps at a sane ceiling, and (3) falls back to work-experience entry count when no dates are parseable.\n\n- resume_kw=None is tolerated end-to-end; flatten_resume and score_resume_against_jd no longer crash on missing input.\n\n- Fixes optimizer __init__ MatchScore import path (it lives in schemas, not scorer).\n\n- Adds tests/test_scorer.py: 59 tests covering word boundaries, unknown-term fallback, generic-word filtering, years-of-experience edge cases, ATS bullet density, and regression coverage for the four originally failing assertions.\n\nTest result: 110 passed (all scorer + security + seniority tests).","tree":{"sha":"f82033e4c3968af464f227b4ae50a33a011dc3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/f82033e4c3968af464f227b4ae50a33a011dc3a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/b512747e00ce95e11c92bacf3cb80b178d974803","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266463060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9","id":266463060,"login":"Nikhilsai-9","node_id":"U_kgDOD-HnVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikhilsai-9/starre