ign tokens\n- Add pro-* dashboard CSS classes to index.css (welcome banner, tools\n  grid, resume list)","tree":{"sha":"4788307bd15e99929e0537ab9f4fd2c1ccd38488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/4788307bd15e99929e0537ab9f4fd2c1ccd38488"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/1cebef725b44b312474476d82cf0b0ca71691f57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/1cebef725b44b312474476d82cf0b0ca71691f57","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDFjZWJlZjcyNWI0NGIzMTI0NzQ0NzZkODJjZjBiMGNhNzE2OTFmNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/55e731b783856653f5c24eddde3352b1be3fda95","sha":"55e731b783856653f5c24eddde3352b1be3fda95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/55e731b783856653f5c24eddde3352b1be3fda95"}],"sha":"1cebef725b44b312474476d82cf0b0ca71691f57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/1cebef725b44b312474476d82cf0b0ca71691f57"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/55e731b783856653f5c24eddde3352b1be3fda95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:05:38Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:05:38Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"message":"fix(deploy): switch to Docker runtime for system deps (Cairo, Pango, poppler)","tree":{"sha":"d04a504dcb9c58611059d991b49f2d98593d5433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/d04a504dcb9c58611059d991b49f2d98593d5433"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/55e731b783856653f5c24eddde3352b1be3fda95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/55e731b783856653f5c24eddde3352b1be3fda95","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDU1ZTczMWI3ODM4NTY2NTNmNWMyNGVkZGRlMzM1MmIxYmUzZmRhOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/4e6c126bc6ea934d54e059e2264fb8a05e06a262","sha":"4e6c126bc6ea934d54e059e2264fb8a05e06a262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/4e6c126bc6ea934d54e059e2264fb8a05e06a262"}],"sha":"55e731b783856653f5c24eddde3352b1be3fda95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/55e731b783856653f5c24eddde3352b1be3fda95"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/4e6c126bc6ea934d54e059e2264fb8a05e06a262/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:04:33Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:04:33Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"message":"fix(deploy): use python -m uvicorn to avoid command lookup issue","tree":{"sha":"2fb1f074f1a5b2a1773c95e81f29ab612c7c6874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/2fb1f074f1a5b2a1773c95e81f29ab612c7c6874"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/4e6c126bc6ea934d54e059e2264fb8a05e06a262","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/4e6c126bc6ea934d54e059e2264fb8a05e06a262","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDRlNmMxMjZiYzZlYTkzNGQ1NGUwNTllMjI2NGZiOGEwNWUwNmEyNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/88f2c84c3c2e32fc290b173e7ee32599080fcfcd","sha":"88f2c84c3c2e32fc290b173e7ee32599080fcfcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/88f2c84c3c2e32fc290b173e7ee32599080fcfcd"}],"sha":"4e6c126bc6ea934d54e059e2264fb8a05e06a262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/4e6c126bc6ea934d54e059e2264fb8a05e06a262"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/88f2c84c3c2e32fc290b173e7ee32599080fcfcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:48:02Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:48:02Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"message":"fix(deploy): switch to Docker runtime, remove package.json bridge\n\nRoot cause: the package.json hack (npm postinstall calling pip install)\nconfused Render buildpack detection, causing the Python backend to fail\nto start.\n\nChanges:\n- render.yaml: runtime python -> docker (installs Cairo/Pango/poppler\n  system deps required by weasyprint and pdf2image)\n- Remove backend/package.json (buildpack-confusing bridge file)\n- Remove unused gunicorn from requirements.txt\n- Add backend/.dockerignore to exclude .env, __pycache__ from image\n\nVerified locally: health endpoint ok, all 47 seniority tests pass,\nOpenAPI generates correctly.","tree":{"sha":"e62dcf2466c529bf58c61dcc1b6e7c93dbc19096","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/e62dcf2466c529bf58c61dcc1b6e7c93dbc19096"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/88f2c84c3c2e32fc290b173e7ee32599080fcfcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/88f2c84c3c2e32fc290b173e7ee32599080fcfcd","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDg4ZjJjODRjM2MyZTMyZmMyOTBiMTczZTdlZTMyNTk5MDgwZmNmY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/074ceee9444cf5c2f7524c5bead265bed454e69e","sha":"074ceee9444cf5c2f7524c5bead265bed454e69e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/074ceee9444cf5c2f7524c5bead265bed454e69e"}],"sha":"88f2c84c3c2e32fc290b173e7ee32599080fcfcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/88f2c84c3c2e32fc290b173e7ee32599080fcfcd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/074ceee9444cf5c2f7524c5bead265bed454e69e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:18:35Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:18:35Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"message":"fix(deploy): resolve Render deployment failure with render.yaml, bridge package.json, and Dockerfile","tree":{"sha":"8388243ccad655b9c88cea6260a40ea106173d80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/8388243ccad655b9c88cea6260a40ea106173d80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/074ceee9444cf5c2f7524c5bead265bed454e69e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/074ceee9444cf5c2f7524c5bead265bed454e69e","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDA3NGNlZWU5NDQ0Y2Y1YzJmNzUyNGM1YmVhZDI2NWJlZDQ1NGU2OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/c979331c051424677f3bbc73dd67a733efeb0143","sha":"c979331c051424677f3bbc73dd67a733efeb0143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/c979331c051424677f3bbc73dd67a733efeb0143"}],"sha":"074ceee9444cf5c2f7524c5bead265bed454e69e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/074ceee9444cf5c2f7524c5bead265bed454e69e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/c979331c051424677f3bbc73dd67a733efeb0143/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:10:41Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:10:41Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"message":"feat(optimizer): AI Resume Optimizer backend - JD analysis + seniority fix\n\nAdds the backend foundation for the AI Resume Optimizer feature:\n\n* backend/app/services/optimizer/\n    - jd_analyzer.py: parses JD text into role, seniority, must-have /\n      nice-to-have sections, and a curated set of extracted keywords.\n    - keywords.py: lexicon-driven technical / soft-skill extraction with\n      phrase-aware matching (handles \"machine learning\", \"react native\").\n    - schemas.py: Pydantic contracts for analyzer output and request / response.\n    - __init__.py: lazy re-exports so callers don''t pay for imports they\n      don''t use.\n    - ATTRIBUTION.md: provenance notes for the lexicons used.\n\n* Bugfix bundled with this commit:\n  The legacy _detect_seniority() iterated a priority-ordered keyword list\n  and returned the first hit. A JD like\n      \"Senior Full Stack Engineer ... Mentor junior engineers\"\n  collapsed to \"junior\" because \"junior\" outranked \"senior\" in the list\n  and the title was never inspected as a separate signal.\n\n  Replaced with a strict 4-tier resolution order:\n    1. role title (strongest signal)\n    2. must-have / requirements section\n    3. years-of-experience anywhere\n    4. whole-JD keyword fallback (last resort)\n  Word-boundary regexes prevent \"lead\" -> \"leader\" and\n  \"intern\" -> \"internal\" false positives. The function signature\n  `_detect_seniority(text) -> Optional[str]` is unchanged so the call\n  site in analyze_job_description is untouched.\n\n* scripts/make_test_resume.py + scripts/sample-resume.pdf:\n  Source-and-asset pair used for manual smoke testing of the optimizer\n  pipeline. The PDF is a 3KB real PDF built with ReportLab.\n\n* tests/conftest.py + tests/test_seniority_detector.py:\n  47 pytest tests covering all seven user-listed cases (title\n  precedence both directions, staff / principal / intern titles, years\n  variants: \"5+\", \"at least\", \"minimum\", \"2 to 4\", \"over\") plus direct\n  helper coverage and negative matches (\"leader\", \"internal\").\n  conftest.py adds backend/ to sys.path so tests can be run from the repo\n  root without a virtualenv dance.\n\n* .gitignore: add Python __pycache__, *.pyc, .pytest_cache/ so the new\n  tests directory doesn''t leave bytecode lying around.\n\nNot yet wired: scorer.py, tailor.py, storage.py, routes_optimizer.py,\nmain.py router include, frontend view. Coming in subsequent commits.\n\nTests:\n  47 passed in 0.23s (pytest tests/test_seniority_detector.py)\n\nFiles:\n  A .gitignore\n  A backend/app/services/optimizer/ATTRIBUTION.md\n  A backend/app/services/optimizer/__init__.py\n  A backend/app/services/optimizer/jd_analyzer.py\n  A backend/app/services/optimizer/keywords.py\n  A backend/app/services/optimizer/schemas.py\n  A scripts/make_test_resume.py\n  A scripts/sample-resume.pdf\n  A tests/conftest.py\n  A tests/test_seniority_detector.py","tree":{"sha":"8053f2907523e21f03a6fd5ad9ac14ffd3b1b5d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/8053f2907523e21f03a6fd5ad9ac14ffd3b1b5d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/c979331c051424677f3bbc73dd67a733efeb0143","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/c979331c051424677f3bbc73dd67a733efeb0143","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKGM5NzkzMzFjMDUxNDI0Njc3ZjNiYmM3M2RkNjdhNzMzZWZlYjAxNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/147662962110b9768938405fe943f59c63de10ae","sha":"147662962110b9768938405fe943f59c63de10ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/147662962110b9768938405fe943f59c63de10ae"}],"sha":"c979331c051424677f3bbc73dd67a733efeb0143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/c979331c051424677f3bbc73dd67a733efeb0143"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/147662962110b9768938405fe943f59c63de10ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:09:16Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:09:16Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"message":"fix(resume): PDF upload robustness - Content-Type, magic header, error categorisation\n\nTwo complementary fixes for the resume PDF upload flow:\n\n* frontend: stop hardcoding \"Content-Type: multipart/form-data\" on the upload.\n  The browser must generate the boundary parameter automatically; a\n  hardcoded Content-Type without a boundary made python-multipart reject\n  the body, which surfaced to users as\n  \"We couldn''t read this file. Please try another PDF.\"\n\n* backend: stage-tagged logging (MIME / size / header sniff / parse /\n  validation) so failures are easy to localise in the terminal. Split\n  extraction crashes (500) from \"parsed but empty\" outcomes (422).\n  Add a %PDF- magic-header sniff and an empty-file guard.\n\nNo public API changes. Status codes are more accurate but no client-visible\nfield shape changes.\n\nFiles:\n  M backend/app/api/routes_resume.py\n  M frontend/src/api/api.js","tree":{"sha":"fbc60c1c26c0a99f1652424533742f58f3a591bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/fbc60c1c26c0a99f1652424533742f58f3a591bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/147662962110b9768938405fe943f59c63de10ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/147662962110b9768938405fe943f59c63de10ae","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDE0NzY2Mjk2MjExMGI5NzY4OTM4NDA1ZmU5NDNmNTljNjNkZTEwYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/6d853fb98f100b79970c88ea35065e11d495a079","sha":"6d853fb98f100b79970c88ea35065e11d495a079","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/6d853fb98f100b79970c88ea35065e11d495a079"}],"sha":"147662962110b9768938405fe943f59c63de10ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/147662962110b9768938405fe943f59c63de10ae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commits/6d853fb98f100b79970c88ea35065e11d495a079/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:04:03Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:04:03Z","email":"agriseva.ai@gmail.com","name":"AgriSeva-AI"},"message":"feat(backend): switch LLM provider from OpenAI to Google Gemini\n\n- Replace OpenAI SDK with official google-genai SDK\n- Rename env vars OPENAI_API_KEY/OPENAI_MODEL -> GEMINI_API_KEY/GEMINI_MODEL\n- Default model is now gemini-1.5-flash (free tier available)\n- New LLMClient.chat_json() converts OpenAI-style messages into\n  google-genai Contents + system_instruction, supports response_schema\n  structured output\n- HealthResponse field renamed openai_configured -> gemini_configured\n- Update .env.example, README.md, docstrings, requirements.txt\n- All 9 API routes still register; health check returns gemini_configured","tree":{"sha":"dbfe2a89a4761121d2809f5fda466112982d2894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/dbfe2a89a4761121d2809f5fda466112982d2894"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/6d853fb98f100b79970c88ea35065e11d495a079","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/commit/6d853fb98f100b79970c88ea35065e11d495a079","node_id":"C_kwDOUC5jztoAKDZkODUzZmI5OGYxMDBiNzk5NzBjODhlYTM1MDY1ZTExZDQ5NWEwNzk