t LangGraph workflow with 5 agents (rules_loader, input_loader, job_analyzer, resume_generator, resume_qa) and deterministic safe fallback\n- Add Firebase Admin auth dependency with dev bypass support\n- Add PDF extraction (pypdf + vision fallback), DOCX/PDF/Markdown/JSON export, file-based per-user storage\n- Add CORS, health endpoint, templates endpoint, full resume CRUD, generate + export routes\n- Rewrite frontend api.js to talk to Python backend with Firebase ID token headers\n- Replace old builder/templates code with new 9-step ResumeBuilderView + LivePreview + ResumeBuilder.css\n- Keep Firebase login/signup, AuthProvider, ProtectedRoute unchanged","tree":{"sha":"1cf8bb9e21c10a44d6094fd2b8a13b81de8f1187","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/trees/1cf8bb9e21c10a44d6094fd2b8a13b81de8f1187"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikhilsai-9/FreeGraduates/git/commits/116fbed8089e4d326bdb4258520f3d150adf16e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/