an.mp4 fallback (rendered without left-side editor watermark) + Cargo_ship_leaving_industrial_dock_202608261937.mp4.\n\n• client/public/img/: maritime stock images (hero_port, hero_ship, containers, port_cranes, vessel_sea) for ImageMarquee + ImageCard3D.\n\n• start-all.sh: single-file launcher. (1) ml: venv + pip install + train.py if missing. (2) server: npm install if missing. (3) client: npm install if missing. Polls /api/health, /api/ml/health, http://localhost:5173/ with 30s timeout. Writes PIDs to /tmp/portcast-*.pid.\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"c1497be2122b96d6e20be467a1e15590cbbf798e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shaswata-codes/PortCast/git/trees/c1497be2122b96d6e20be467a1e15590cbbf798e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shaswata-codes/PortCast/git/commits/80e0b9165fdf211b7ca420ddb84a26f65206c7f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195780830?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vagishvedansh","id":195780830,"login":"vagishvedansh","node_id":"U_kgDOC6tg3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https:/