lain endpoint + 7-day warning for capacity overfill\n\n• controllers/portcastController.js: new getExplanation() — pure-Node SHAP-lite endpoint that doesn''t call Python.\n\n• Uses ml/models/model_metadata.json top_features (LightGBM gain importance) + deterministic per-route seed (routeId charCodeAt sum) to produce stable direction + magnitude per route.\n\n• Returns {routeId, routeName, commodity, baseRate, drivers: top-5, allFeatures, method, note}.\n\n• Groups features into Momentum / Trend / Volatility for color encoding on the UI.\n\n• routes/api.js: POST /api/explain wired.\n\n• mlBridgeService.js: new fetchMLOptimize (already in use via /api/optimize), re-anchor logic in /forecast.\n\n• optimizerEngine.js: 7-day vs 14-day vs 30-day forecast cache + TripBunker 1.05× Bunker + Haldia lighterage $5.25/MT + 1 day for Supramax/Panamax on Haldia.\n\n• FitsOnPost: vessel class × port draft/LOA/beam compliance matrix (HS/SM/PM/CS ticks).\n\n• Smart Port Finder: 9 East Coast ports ranked by Effective Cost per MT for a given origin + parcel + bunker.\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"0cb721e227763c59ad83cdf4bf66b2b4c4e9f5d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shaswata-codes/PortCast/git/trees/0cb721e227763c59ad83cdf4bf66b2b4c4e9f5d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shaswata-codes/PortCast/git/commits/95d6f50604495b4fb0967661aa4963aa3bc39a01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195780830?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vagishvedansh","id":195780830,"login":"vagishvedansh"