":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shaswata-codes/PortCast/commits/8b83e24b133ff0c5906c3f07979f72bbff94b61b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T04:26:20Z","email":"vagishvedansh@gmail.com","name":"vagishvedansh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T04:26:20Z","email":"vagishvedansh@gmail.com","name":"vagishvedansh"},"message":"feat(client): rebuild UI with 6 product views, glass system, SHAP panel, What-If simulator\n\n• New preview_new/ codebase: 6 lazy-loaded routes (Home, Dashboard, Forecaster, Optimizer, Ports, Risk) with hash-based router.\n\n• Glass system: --pc-card 0.96, glass-card-dense 0.98, blur 20/24, shadow 0.13, beam 0.88.\n\n• WCAG 2.1: hero text-shadow halo, slate-700/rose-700 contrast upgrades, prefers-reduced-motion media query.\n\n• A11y: aria-label on icon-only buttons (Risk presets, chokepoint toggles, filter clear, alerts severity chips, region select).\n\n• Booking heatmap: cheapest-day ★ marker, today-line, hover tooltip D+N · $/MT, threshold 0.1% so gradient always fires.\n\n• What-If Stress Simulator: 3 sliders × bunker ±30 / congestion ±25 / demand ±20, live multiplicative P10/P90 morph, shock-state colors (rose up, emerald down, sky baseline), inline Reset, above-chart shock banner.\n\n• Spot vs TC & COA Comparison: 5-column table (Type / Rate / Δ vs Spot / Duration / Risk), zebra rows, parcel size input (1k-400k MT), 4 cumulative cost tiles with Best contract badge, Cumulative Cost Pareto bar chart.\n\n• Cumulative Cost Pareto: 4-bar chart (emerald for cheapest, sky for others), Y-axis in $X.XM, LabelList on each bar.\n\n• <ExplainabilityPanel /> (SHAP-lite): fetches /api/explain, renders top-5 driver contributions as horizontal bars grouped by Momentum/Trend/Volatility, signed +X% with TrendingUp/Down icons, loading + error states.\n\n• Risk Radar: severity (ALL/HIGH/MED/LOW) + region (8 chokepoints) filter chips, Jump-to-Simulator anchor, empty state, Stress Simulator Reset + formula explainer, 3 scenario presets.\n\n• Dashboard: Active Risk Alerts pill uses LOW/MED/HIGH semantic scale, sparklines get XAxis/YAxis to prevent edge clipping.\n\n• Port Restrictions: filter input with search icon + clear button (X), ARIA labels throughout.\n\n• Ticker: 2% edge fade mask (was 4%, fixed for first-chip clip), Live pulse chip (animate-ping) in top-right, aria-hidden.\n\n• Full-page voyage video background with 11% watermark crop + 62% object-position so editor watermark stays off-screen; 140-frame canvas scrubber fallback.\n\n• OceanBackground: crossfade dual-video loop for non-Home routes (Dashboard, Forecaster, Optimizer, Ports, Risk).\n\n• Navbar: solid bg-white + backdrop-blur-xl (was translucent).\n\n• AnimatedCard / ScrollReveal: replaced motion.div + whileInView with plain div + CSS viewEnter keyframe to fix opacity-0 trap (WebBridge viewport never triggered whileInView, every mid-page card rendered blank).\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"430eafc4b8fc02fcc997e365bda442143d058efb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shaswata-codes/PortCast/git/trees/430eafc4b8fc02fcc997e365bda442143d058efb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shaswata-codes/PortCast/git/commits/8b83e24b133ff0c5906c3f07979f72bbff94b61b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195780830?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vagishvedansh/events{/privacy}