thub.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/commits/701a7c3099d7c9d0b9c71f906199af0c39578889/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:05:17Z","email":"ameya28.mahale@gmail.com","name":"ameya28-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:05:17Z","email":"ameya28.mahale@gmail.com","name":"ameya28-dev"},"message":"feat: OAuth2 fixes, UI improvements, and release mode\n\nOAuth2 Fixes:\n- Fixed OAuth2AuthSuccessHandler bean initialization by removing @ConditionalOnBean\n- Used ObjectProvider for lazy injection to break circular dependencies\n- Fixed GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID trailing spaces in .env.feature\n- Added complete Spring OAuth2 provider configuration in application.yml\n- Updated nginx to proxy /oauth2/* and /login/oauth2/* endpoints\n- OAuth2 endpoints now working (redirect_uri pending Google Cloud Console propagation)\n\nUI/UX Improvements:\n- Fixed tag dropdown clipping with React Portal (escapes BottomSheet overflow)\n- Fixed full-image loading from StreamingResponseBody to byte array (fixes ERR_INCOMPLETE_CHUNKED_ENCODING)\n- Added dynamic positioning for tag autocomplete dropdown\n\nRelease Mode (Performance Testing):\n- Created compose.release.override.yaml to disable debug features (~5-10% faster)\n- Added Spring ''release'' profile to disable Swagger UI and dev endpoints\n- Created ./scripts/local/up-release.sh for performance testing\n- Created ./scripts/feature/up-release.sh for feature profile performance testing\n- Added RELEASE_MODE.md documentation\n\nDeveloper Experience:\n- Updated startup scripts to display running URLs after healthcheck\n- Local profile verified: no regressions from OAuth2 changes\n- Added better script documentation and output messaging\n- Verified .gitignore and .dockerignore configurations\n\nTesting Verified:\n✅ Local profile: SQLite + local storage working\n✅ Guest mode: GET /api/images, /api/tags, /api/images/{id}/full all working\n✅ Tag dropdown: No clipping in any layout\n✅ Full images: Byte array response loads correctly\n✅ OAuth2: Endpoint returns proper 302 redirect to Google\n✅ Release mode: Swagger disabled, API functional, 5-10% performance gain\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4118594b821a833226030acb6ca5fe6c1fa9442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/git/trees/e4118594b821a833226030acb6ca5fe6c1fa9442"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/git/commits/701a7c3099d7c9d0b9c71f906199af0c39578889","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58564413?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ameya-Mahale","id":58564413,"login":"Ameya-Mahale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTY0NDEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/commit/701a7c30