ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/commits/8c2c2cdd077075e73293b378e1fca117fcd5d649/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T17:42:55Z","email":"ameya28.mahale@gmail.com","name":"ameya28-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T17:42:55Z","email":"ameya28.mahale@gmail.com","name":"ameya28-dev"},"message":"chore: add convenient Docker Compose scripts for local and feature profiles\n\n/scripts/local/:\n  - up.sh, down.sh, reset.sh: lifecycle management\n  - debug.sh: start with SQLite Web UI\n  - logs.sh, status.sh: monitoring\n  - rebuild.sh, clean.sh: maintenance\n  - shell-backend.sh, shell-frontend.sh: container access\n\n/scripts/feature/:\n  - up.sh (validates .env.feature), down.sh, reset.sh: lifecycle\n  - logs.sh, status.sh (with env validation): monitoring\n  - rebuild.sh, clean.sh: maintenance\n  - shell-backend.sh, shell-frontend.sh: container access\n\nAll scripts include:\n  - Error handling and validation\n  - Color output and emoji for clarity\n  - Helpful messages and usage hints\n  - Profile-specific configuration\n\nEliminates need to remember long docker compose commands with overlays.\nRun ./scripts/README.md for full reference.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2026667a30c3c2058105546d6f79b45411ec30d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/git/trees/2026667a30c3c2058105546d6f79b45411ec30d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/git/commits/8c2c2cdd077075e73293b378e1fca117fcd5d649","verification":{"payload":null