}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ameya-Mahale","id":58564413,"login":"Ameya-Mahale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTY0NDEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/commits/eb7f760a51d73f3ad200814f2895b0d97df73204/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T17:24:10Z","email":"ameya28.mahale@gmail.com","name":"ameya28-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T17:24:10Z","email":"ameya28.mahale@gmail.com","name":"ameya28-dev"},"message":"feat: profile-gated guest mode elimination and landing page for feature profile\n\n- Backend (SecurityConfig): inject GalleryProperties and branch permitAll() rules\n  by profile (guest access local-only, seed import denyAll() on feature)\n- Backend (GalleryProperties): add guestAccessEnabled/seedImportEnabled boolean\n  properties (local: true/true, feature: false/false)\n- Frontend (environment): add NEXT_PUBLIC_GUEST_MODE and NEXT_PUBLIC_SEED_IMPORT_ENABLED\n  flags to compose.yaml (local: true/true) and compose.feature.override.yaml (false/false)\n- Frontend (env files): add new flags to .env.local\n- Frontend (HomeGate): new client component at root route; branches on profile/auth state\n  (local always gallery, feature: logged-out → landing page, logged-in → gallery)\n- Frontend (LandingPage): new marketing/dashboard page with hero, features, ''how it works'',\n  CTAs, and footer (styled consistently with existing dark theme)\n- Frontend (GalleryPage): gate seed-import trigger with NEXT_PUBLIC_SEED_IMPORT_ENABLED flag\n- Frontend (LoginPage): gate guest hint text with NEXT_PUBLIC_GUEST_MODE flag\n- Frontend (page.tsx): swap GalleryPage for HomeGate at root route\n\nLocal profile: guest browsing/upload/seed-import unchanged (developer sandbox preserved)\nFeature profile: login required for all gallery access; guest mode completely disabled\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"144d32dca268799fc5e91aeda98de77ad70965be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/git/trees/144d32dca268799fc5e91aeda98de77ad70965be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/git/commits/eb7f760a51d73f3ad200814f2895b0d97df73204","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58564413?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ameya-Mahale","id":58564413,"login":"Ameya-Mahale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTY0NDEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ameya-Mahale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ameya28-dev/ImageGallery/commit/eb7f760a51d73f3ad200814f2895b0d97df73204","node_id":"C_kwDOUDDj5toAKG