thor":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:12:56Z","email":"sid@span-eng.com","name":"Sidljackson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T02:12:56Z","email":"sid@span-eng.com","name":"Sidljackson"},"message":"Apply approved customer app icons","tree":{"sha":"b001f2d04c8a55b52a260a3d9e9c3261b727b4ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/indratel-demo/git/trees/b001f2d04c8a55b52a260a3d9e9c3261b727b4ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/indratel-demo/git/commits/137b674e384bac3c1ba2c40d413cf8560eba03c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/indratel-demo/commit/137b674e384bac3c1ba2c40d413cf8560eba03c6","node_id":"C_kwDOUDJPgtoAKDEzN2I2NzRlMzg0YmFjM2MxYmEyYzQwZDQxM2NmODU2MGViYTAzYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/indratel-demo/commit/454d3f418be4060a36bb665cadcf1918e78e166b","sha":"454d3f418be4060a36bb665cadcf1918e78e166b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/indratel-demo/commits/454d3f418be4060a36bb665cadcf1918e78e166b"}],"sha":"137b674e384bac3c1ba2c40d413cf8560eba03c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/indratel-demo/commits/137b674e384bac3c1ba2c40d413cf8560eba03c6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/indratel-demo/commits/454d3f418be4060a36bb665cadcf1918e78e166b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T05:57:55Z","email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T05:57:55Z","email":"jarrod@span-eng.com","name":"Jarrod"},"message":"Mirror the widget placement into the widget channel for device-local HMIs\n\nThe device agent''s local widget viewer reads the device''s partial ui_state,\nwhich never holds this cloud app''s uiRemoteComponent node. It fell back to\nthe widget channel''s data, found no scope/module, sniffed the bundle''s\nuniqueName - hashed by @module-federation/rsbuild-plugin 0.21 - and failed\nwith ''Remote container \"IndratelDemoWidget_1b4c1ad8\" is not available''.\n\nOn every deployment and deployment_config change the processor now merges\nthe resolved remote-component node (scope, module, props) into\n<install>_widget. The control plane''s deploy write to that channel is a\nmerge, so the keys survive redeploys. The write is skipped when the channel\nalready holds the same values, because every write reaches the device as an\naggregate event and the HMI engine reloads its panel on each one; structural\nkeys such as hidden and children stay off the channel, and a prop that\nresolves to nothing is published as null so it clears.\n\nVerified on the Indratel quantum-demo Quantum: with scope/module on the\nchannel the deployed viewer renders the widget with no console errors.","tree":{"sha":"e9b3db2007ae352210254d1f5bbd46f46208fab7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/indratel-demo/git/trees/e9b3db2007ae352210254d1f5bbd46f46208fab7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/indratel-demo/git/commits/454d3f418be4060a36bb665cadcf1918e78e166b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/indratel-demo/commit/454d3f418be4060a36bb665cadcf1918e78e166b","node_id":"C_kwDOUDJPgtoAKDQ1NGQzZjQxOGJlNDA2MGEzNmJiNjY1Y2FkY2YxOTE4ZTc4ZTE2NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/indratel-demo/commit/e3fc447a707f3d1c129f4b216e2e5f1962ccbb08","sha":"e3fc447a707f3d1c129f4b216e2e5f1962ccbb08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/indratel-demo/commits/e3fc447a707f3d1c129f4b216e2e5f1962ccbb08"}],"sha":"454d3f418be4060a36bb665cadcf1918e78e166b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/indratel-demo/commits/454d3f418be4060a36bb665cadcf1918e78e166b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38833292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathsman5133/events{/privacy}","fol