) to docker-compose.yml exposed on\nhost port 8081 for browser-based MySQL inspection during local\ndevelopment, connected to the bank-net bridge network.\n\nUpdate documentation to reflect the new service and align the\ndocumented MySQL host port guidance with the repository default of 3306,\nreplacing the previous 3308 fallback note. Also add a frontend C4\nContexto diagram (C4-1-Contexto.md) and refresh the README service\ntopology table.","tree":{"sha":"97516e95e4a2448d34f1b60878a2fdfdd17368fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andfsanchezag/programacion_web_2026_2/git/trees/97516e95e4a2448d34f1b60878a2fdfdd17368fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andfsanchezag/programacion_web_2026_2/git/commits/e1b2510fafaae6a7c0dd33b4523e0db07ce9be3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140995670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andfsanchezag","id":140995670,"login":"andfsanchezag","node_id":"U_kgDOCGdsVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andfsanchezag/programacion_web_2026_2/commit/e1b2510fafaae6a7c0dd33b4523e0db07ce9be3a","node_id":"C_kwDO