oseLoan; run() honra status 201/202/204;\n  Create&Execute transfers; APPROVED bajo umbral; saldo en creacion;\n  auditoria con filtros y paginacion (push-down Mongo via findPaged)\n- Autorizacion: empresa aprueba transfers (5.3/5.4), supervisor/analista\n  operan transfers (7.x), comercial solicita prestamos (9.1), empresa\n  registra usuarios delegados (5.2); employee register 201 (10.1)\n- Consistencia: compensacion en executeTransfer/disburseLoan\n- Pruebas: 206 unitarias, 13 E2E (test:e2e), seed-data (npm run seed, 60 pasos)","tree":{"sha":"dfc1a8090972e75358061c04fb33c322a10d73ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andfsanchezag/programacion_web_2026_2/git/trees/dfc1a8090972e75358061c04fb33c322a10d73ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andfsanchezag/programacion_web_2026_2/git/commits/3a6c48d18213e7da9dabba0c919aaf9be8b89e50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140995670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andfsanchezag","id":140995670,"login":"andfsanchezag","node_id":"U_kgDOCGdsVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfsanchezag","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andfsanchezag/