 (rotas lazy),\n  src/app/mfe/*.component.ts (placeholders das 4 áreas).\n- webpack.config.js (Module Federation) mantido — a troca das rotas para\n  loadRemoteModule é local a app.routes.ts, documentada em apps/README.md.\n- .github/workflows/enterprise-v2.yml: job web-shell (npm ci + npm run build).\n- README/CHANGELOG: Angular 🗺️ -> ✅ builda.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ee09b4fe197cfca859cbdf5ee57be67c4f14670","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/git/trees/2ee09b4fe197cfca859cbdf5ee57be67c4f14670"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/git/commits/87f7a9e5194bf2cd928e7245a7a9d7f8aec9b9cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93944072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yuri-Fernando","id":93944072,"login":"Yuri-Fernando","node_id":"U_kgDOBZl5CA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/commit/87f7a9e5194bf2cd928e7245a7a9d7f8aec9b9cc","node_id":"C_kwDOUDPjytoAKDg3ZjdhOWU1MTk0YmYyY2Q5MjhlNzI0NWE3YTlkN2Y4YWVjOWI5Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https: