cker compose\n  (Redpanda + RabbitMQ + Postgres) + RUN_INTEGRATION=1 pytest -m integration\n  passou (roundtrip Kafka, roundtrip RabbitMQ, fluxo predição->outbox->\n  relay->Kafka).\n- customer-service (Java) -> ✅ COMPILA E TESTA: mvn verify com JDK 17\n  Temurin, 5 testes JUnit verdes. Maven wrapper (./mvnw) incluído + job\n  java-customer-service no workflow enterprise-v2.yml.\n- KafkaBus/RabbitBus: consume_batch() (consumo não-bloqueante) — viabilizou\n  os testes de integração.\n\nFixed (descobertos ao rodar de verdade):\n- outbox.py: SqliteOutbox mantém 1 conexão persistente (a versão anterior\n  reconectava por op, o que quebra com :memory:).\n- EmailAddress.java: escapes de regex inválidos em string Java (\\s -> \\s).\n\nREADME/CHANGELOG: Java e Kafka/RabbitMQ passam de 🗺️/🚧 para ✅.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de20e383047e399a104a5564c476f2506151892b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/git/trees/de20e383047e399a104a5564c476f2506151892b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/git/commits/e1808f707d9989570a11bc4a123893d438f3c635","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93944072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yuri-Fernando","id":93944072,"login":"Yuri-Fernando","node_id":"U_kgDOBZl5CA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/commit/e1808f707d9989570a11bc4a123893d438f3c635","node_id":"C_kwDOUDPjytoAKGUxODA4ZjcwN2Q5OTg5NTcwYTExYmM0YTEyMzg5M2Q0MzhmM2M2MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/commit/cfb08d2d9d03f4bc7c1148f42fc19b4017c73874","sha":"cfb08d2d9d03f4bc7c1148f42fc19b4017c73874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/commits/cfb08d2d9d03f4bc7c1148f42fc19b4017c73874"}],"sha":"e1808f707d9989570a11bc4a123893d438f3c635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/commits/e1808f707d9989570a11bc4a123893d438f3c635"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93944072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yuri-Fernando","id":93944072,"login":"Yuri-Fernando","node_id":"U_kgDOBZl5CA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/commits/cfb08d2d9d03f4bc7c1148f42fc19b4017c73874/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:08:52Z","email":"yuri_dubbern@hotmail.com","name":"Yuri Fernando"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:08:52Z","email":"yuri_dubbern@hotmail.com","name":"Yuri Fernando"},"message":"feat: v2.1 - gRPC + transactional outbox + read models CQRS + Data Mesh contracts + CI\n\nTorna concretos (com testes reais) itens antes 🗺️/🚧 na Capability Status\ntable — sem custo de nuvem.\n\n- gRPC no inference-service (ADR-021): proto/inference.proto + stubs +\n  grpc_server.py; teste garante REST e gRPC = mesmo score.\n- Transactional Outbox (ADR-022): infrastructure/outbox.py (SQLite) +\n  relay() idempotente; teste de recuperação pós-crash (exactly-once).\n- Read models CQRS (ADR-022/RFC-002): platform/read_models/ — ChurnReadModel\n  + teste de equivalência replay <-> incremental.\n- Data Mesh contracts (RFC-001): data-platform/data-products/*/contract.yaml\n  (4 domínios) + validate.py + testes.\n- KafkaBus/RabbitBus.consume_batch() (não-bloqueante) + test_integration.py\n  (@pytest.mark.integration, roundtrip real, skipa sem broker).\n- docker-compose.enterprise.yml (Redpanda+RabbitMQ+Postgres) + alvos no\n  Makefile (up-enterprise, test-enterprise, test-integration, proto).\n- .github/workflows/enterprise-v2.yml (job unit + job integration com\n  brokers reais).\n- inference-service: 13 -> 20 testes. README/CHANGELOG atualizados.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1523fbe752c7256f88e9c72f5606668c1f298f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/git/trees/d1523fbe752c7256f88e9c72f5606668c1f298f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/git/commits/cfb08d2d9d03f4bc7c1148f42fc19b4017c73874","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93944072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yuri-Fernando/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.githu