mit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:38:06Z","email":"yuri_dubbern@hotmail.com","name":"Yuri Fernando"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:38:06Z","email":"yuri_dubbern@hotmail.com","name":"Yuri Fernando"},"message":"feat: v2 - camada de arquitetura enterprise (DDD, EDA, system design)\n\nEvolução aditiva (ADR-016) — o pipeline de dados Azure/Databricks/Snowflake\npermanece intacto. Adiciona a dimensão de arquitetura de software usando\nCustomer Intelligence como domínio de negócio. Tudo com status ✅/🚧/🗺️\nna Capability Status table do README.\n\nImplementado e testado (✅):\n- services/inference-service/ (Python/FastAPI) — DDD/hexagonal +\n  Strategy/Factory/Adapter/Ports&Adapters, domain event PredictionMade,\n  13 testes, roda com uvicorn.\n- platform/messaging/ — MessageBus (InMemoryBus/KafkaBus/RabbitBus) +\n  SchemaRegistry + ValidatingBus + JSON Schemas por tópico + demo.py.\n  5 testes.\n- ml-platform/adversarial-evaluation/ — robustness gate de MLOps (RFC-002),\n  consome ModelSecurityReport do ThemisAI via protocolo estrutural. 5 testes.\n- tests/bdd/ — behave (Gherkin PT-BR), 2 cenários.\n- docs/system-design/ (00..14), docs/decisions/ADR-016..024 (24 ADRs no\n  total), docs/rfc/ (Data Mesh, ML Platform), docs/c4/ (Mermaid),\n  docs/standards/.\n\nReferência / skeleton (🗺️):\n- terraform/modules/aws/ (network/eks/msk/observability) — terraform fmt ok.\n- services/customer-service/ (Java/Spring Boot 3) — pom válido, DDD\n  completo, CustomerAggregateTest; não compilado (sem JDK17/Maven).\n- platform/service-mesh/istio/ — manifests mTLS/canary.\n- apps/web-shell/ — Angular 18 + Module Federation.\n\nTambém: merge com o release público inicial do Argus no GitHub (históricos\nnão relacionados, reconciliados favorecendo o working copy local).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"398ba8f77bcb05137953612b25a0d11a9c2c4d27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yuri-Fernando/Argus/git/trees/398ba8f77bcb05137953