https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NightMare2210","id":190544727,"login":"NightMare2210","node_id":"U_kgDOC1t7Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commits/044dfa0090d836806ce6f1e70c3c267fe1ee72c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:06:56Z","email":"danielcabrera27.personal@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Cabrera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T07:06:56Z","email":"danielcabrera27.personal@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Cabrera"},"message":"fix(mf-reservas): reservar/cancelar es exclusivo del rol usuario\n\nNinguna regla de negocio (RN-01 a RN-08) le da al admin una reserva\npropia — su único rol respecto a \"reservas\" es RN-03 (cancelar la de\ncualquiera, vía el panel de mf-administracion). Sin embargo /reservas\nestaba bajo RequireAuth sin restricción de rol, así que admin también\nveía \"Nueva reserva\" y \"Mis reservas\".\n\nBloquea ambas rutas para admin con defensa en profundidad (no solo se\noculta el link, la ruta en sí no se monta): admin ve únicamente\nDisponibilidad (de solo lectura, sin efecto de negocio). Usuario\nmantiene el flujo completo sin cambios.","tree":{"sha":"02074d2f1a21adfcdf4db341b441b9da8b866725","ur