"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commits/cd1087ed2bccf3793767499990abb9a0b2b3bca3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T03:54:18Z","email":"danielcabrera27.personal@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Cabrera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T03:54:18Z","email":"danielcabrera27.personal@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Cabrera"},"message":"fix(frontend): agrega sub-navegación interna en mf-reservas y mf-administracion\n\nBug real (2026-08-28): el shell solo linkea a las 3 secciones top-level\n(/reservas, /administracion, /reportes). Ningún remote exponía\nnavegación hacia sus propias sub-rutas: \"Nueva reserva\" y \"Mis\nreservas\" en mf-reservas, y el panel de cancelación admin (RN-03) en\nmf-administracion solo eran alcanzables tipeando la URL a mano — sin\nningún link visible en la UI.\n\nAgrega un sub-nav propio en el App.tsx de cada remote (cada uno ya es\ndueño de su router interno relativo), con TDD: tests que confirman los\nlinks existen y navegan a la pantalla correcta.","tree":{"sha":"dfc2105f126fca5d34ac5efd9c40896e6b5c257c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/trees/dfc2105f126fca5d34ac5efd9c40896e6b5c257c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/commits/cd1087ed2bccf3793767499990abb9a0b2b3bca3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190544727?v=4"