htMare2210","id":190544727,"login":"NightMare2210","node_id":"U_kgDOC1t7Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commits/636d6ba648d1d5100ac0b4e6edf6d1e236dbbc20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T03:41:26Z","email":"danielcabrera27.personal@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Cabrera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T03:41:26Z","email":"danielcabrera27.personal@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Cabrera"},"message":"fix(mf-reservas): valida fecha en disponibilidad y evita mostrar errores crudos del backend\n\nBug real (2026-08-28): input[type=date] no impide vía teclado un año\nde más de 4 dígitos (ej. \"92026-02-08\"). Ese string llegaba sin\nfiltrar hasta ms-reservas, que respondía 422 con el mensaje interno\nde validación de Pydantic en inglés (\"Input should be a valid\ninteger, unable to parse string as an integer\") — mostrado tal cual\nal usuario.\n\nAgrega isValidFecha (domain/rules.ts) como filtro antes de propagar\nel cambio en CanchaFechaPicker, y cambia mapApiError para nunca\nconfiar en el detail crudo de un 422 (a diferencia de 400, donde el\nbackend sí manda español curado para el usuario).","tree":{"sha":"71b2b8c148a7f0b19f9f4e09aec9f226249d3534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/trees/71b2b8c148a7f0b19f9f4e09aec9f226249d3534"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/commits/636d6ba648d1d5100ac0b4e6edf6d1e236dbbc20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":