de reservas\n\nReemplaza el placeholder RemoteHealthCard por el módulo real: ABM de\ncanchas + horarios de atención (RN-07, solo admin) y panel global de\nreservas con cancelación de cualquier usuario, sin bypass de RN-04\n(RN-03). Mismo patrón de capas ya validado en mf-reservas (adapter\nraw→dto→mappers→api sobre shell/apiClient, domain/rules.ts puro,\nhooks useResource/useAction propios, MSW para tests).\n\nTDD estricto de punta a punta, 97 tests nuevos. Corrige en el camino\nun bug real: el formulario de editar cancha se cerraba solo ante un\n400 (nombre duplicado), perdiendo lo tipeado por el admin — ahora\ndistingue 400 (mostrar error, mantener el form) de 404 (recurso\nborrado, sí refetchea).\n\ndocs: agrega observaciones para Cristian sobre 4 hallazgos del\nbackend de ms-canchas/ms-usuarios detectados durante el diseño (no\nbloqueantes, ninguno tocado en este cambio).","tree":{"sha":"067983ed66fdc40f32b54c275699cab1eb2c6ddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/trees/067983ed66fdc40f32b54c275699cab1eb2c6ddb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/commits/c0ba3d9e999844199155fa6f39e7e55f62f6906d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190544727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NightMare2210","id":190544727,"login":"NightMare2210","node_id":"U_kgDOC1t7Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/N