":{"date":"2026-08-27T23:26:04Z","email":"danielcabrera27.personal@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Cabrera"},"message":"docs: ADR de frontend y backend con NFR derivados\n\n12 ADR de frontend-shell/mf-reservas-booking reconstruidos desde el\ncódigo real, y 6 ADR de backend documentados desde afuera (observados,\na confirmar por Cristian) a partir de docker-compose, JWT y la\nvalidación de RN-02 en ms-reservas. Cada ADR incluye su propia sección\nde Requisitos No Funcionales derivados.","tree":{"sha":"e48463f18dbcaf86066f0f1e22f1c88ddf237477","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/trees/e48463f18dbcaf86066f0f1e22f1c88ddf237477"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/commits/372da9715e381a49bbf25b45e31d065ec7624f2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190544727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NightMare2210","id":190544727,"login":"NightMare2210","node_id":"U_kgDOC1t7Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commit/372da9715e381a49bbf25b45e31d065ec7624f2a","no