erificado contra el código real (no supuesto), el contrato\nde rutas que el frontend ya asume (proxy de dev del shell), el JWT\ncompartido entre los 4 microservicios (mismo SECRET_KEY/HS256) y que\nningún ms-* registra CORS todavía. Pensado para que Wilson no tenga que\ndiseñar el gateway a ciegas.","tree":{"sha":"74d97ebadb9378376ded12721e152fea11a46435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/trees/74d97ebadb9378376ded12721e152fea11a46435"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/commits/689486ee2afe8976c8cc8c7c3c847ba2a0baf1eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190544727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NightMare2210","id":190544727,"login":"NightMare2210","node_id":"U_kgDOC1t7Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commit/689486ee2afe8976c8cc8c7c3c847ba2a0baf1eb","node_id":"C_kwDOUDQVgtoAKDY4OTQ4NmVlMmFmZTg5NzZjOGNjOGM3YzNjODQ3YmEyYTBiYWYxZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commit/ccad5aa31c7ea8965fdc839c4e5ccc5eb32afaf8","sha":"ccad5aa31c7ea8965fdc839c4e5ccc5eb32afaf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commits/ccad5aa31c7ea8965fdc839c4e5ccc5eb32afaf8"}],"sha":"689486ee2afe8976c8cc8c7c3c847ba2a0baf1eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commits/689486ee2afe8976c8cc8c7c3c847ba2a0baf1eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190544727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NightMare2210","id":190544727,"login":"NightMare2210","node_id":"U_kgDOC1t7Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commits/ccad5aa31c7ea8965fdc839c4e5ccc5eb32afaf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T20:10:48Z","email":"danielcabrera27.personal@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Cabrera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T20:10:48Z","email":"danielcabrera27.personal@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Cabrera"},"message":"fix(frontend): mf-reservas consume el contrato real de disponibilidad\n\nCristian implementó GET /reservas/disponibilidad con un shape distinto\nal propuesto (list[ReservaResponse] en vez de una grilla armada). El\nadapter ahora arma la grilla libre/ocupado del lado del cliente,\ncruzando eso con GET /horarios-atencion (ms-canchas, recién consumido\npor primera vez). El DTO de salida no cambió, así que ninguna pantalla\nse tocó — es justo lo que la capa adapter estaba pensada para absorber.\n\nusuario_id de terceros (presente en la respuesta real) nunca se\npropaga al DTO — cubierto con test de contrato explícito.\n\n.gitignore: agrega .mf/ (diagnostics de Module Federation, generado en\ncada pnpm dev, mismo caso que @mf-types/).","tree":{"sha":"afbca82c0a4f33a1e6fc5938e0b3400c72d1d0fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/trees/afbca82c0a4f33a1e6fc5938e0b3400c72d1d0fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/commits/ccad5aa31c7ea8965fdc839c4e5ccc5eb32afaf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190544727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NightMare2210","id":190544727,"login":"NightMare2210","node_id":"U_kgDOC1t7Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/commit/ccad5aa31c7ea8965fdc839c4e5ccc5eb32afaf8","no