 estilos deliberado, solo visual — sin tocar lógica de negocio,\nhooks ni el adapter. Token system compartido (paleta cancha de pádel:\nverde turf + terracota solo para \"ocupado\"/errores; Space Grotesk +\nInter + IBM Plex Mono) duplicado en las 4 apps. La grilla de\ndisponibilidad como signature element (pizarra de turnos con\nhorarios en mono y chips libre/ocupado).\n\nAuditado contra Web Interface Guidelines: contraste de texto\ncorregido (tokens derivados --turf-text/--clay-text sobre AA),\nsoporte prefers-reduced-motion, foco de teclado visible.\n\n144/144 tests sin cambios de comportamiento.","tree":{"sha":"b3a653f28b0dd41fdb46a9ae0558ae454060e9fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/trees/b3a653f28b0dd41fdb46a9ae0558ae454060e9fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CristianDv7/CanchasDeportivas/git/commits/333009256542050dc6af2665c2ad5edf1a034f4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190544727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NightMare2210","id":190544727,"login":"NightMare2210","node_id":"U_kgDOC1t7Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NightMare2210","user_view_type":"