tml_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/commits/42bb419dcf6abb89877a4d9b58eaeccb0187c8d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:09:33Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:09:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(context-map): align neighbour subdomain classifications (#152)\n\nNeighbour labels on the context map must match each context''s own\nsubdomain-classification page: order-management is Generic/Supporting,\nwarehouse-planning is Core, process-path-management is Generic.\nAlso uses the fleet-standard quadrant label on the core domain chart.","tree":{"sha":"78b5d3bb78e30203064e6ecba89356c382828dd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/git/trees/78b5d3bb78e30203064e6ecba89356c382828dd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/git/commits/42bb419dcf6abb89877a4d9b58eaeccb0187c8d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 78b5d3bb78e30203064e6ecba89356c382828dd1\nparent ec24959ed6f7fc5a3fa5b5aca6068f0d6cb86dc6\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791270573 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791270573 -0300\n\ndocs(context-map): align neighbour subdomain classifications (#152)\n\nNeighbour labels on the context map must match each context''s own\nsubdomain-classification pag