d t.Skip''d; the CI integration job provisions no Postgres, so the OrderRepo/OutboxPublisher tests silently skipped in CI. newPool now delegates to outboxDB (testcontainers). Adds TestPostgresIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers (+ detector fixtures) so the shape cannot regress, wires the three integration packages CI never ran (inbound/http, analyticsstore, cmd/order) into the integration job and Makefile, and fixes stale README/header comments.\n\n* refactor(order): single Rehydrate(OrderSnapshot) entry point; New no longer mutates caller lines (audit F5)\n\nCollapses Rehydrate/RehydrateWithGroups/RehydrateHeld into one Rehydrate(OrderSnapshot) (HeldAtIntake inverse keeps the safe zero value; Version 0 -> 1; RequiredShipBy now part of the snapshot so the repo no longer calls SetRequiredShipBy after rehydrating). New copies each line before numbering instead of writing lineNo through the caller''s *OrderLine. Updates the repository, PromisePolicy scratch computation and all test callers; adds tests for both behaviours. Separate commit so it can be reverted alone.","tree":{"sha":"b1e6991a5497ceaecfd2b6345c00ff5ff45d8151","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/git/trees/b1e6991a5497ceaecfd2b6345c00ff5ff45d8151"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/git/commits/dcbd87c83b3144a24ee6d6d07a719c38df771901","verification":{"payload":"tree b1e6991a5497ceaecfd2b6345c00ff5ff45d8151\nparent 1615baa66f291fc7b1d4d1ae2c7c2edf6178ff7e\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791252049 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791252049 -0300\n\nTier-1 audit fixes: OrderRepo Postgres tests on testcontainers (F1 CI escape), sensor, Order aggregate cleanup (F5) (#146)\n\n* test: run OrderRepo Postgres integration tests on testcontainers + sensor (audit F1)\n\norder_repo_integration_test.go gated on DATABASE_URL and t.Skip''d; the CI integration job provisions no Postgres, so the OrderRepo/OutboxPublisher tests silent