https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/commits/85a448183c1fe36eaeb47ad5c403c67bbe5fee4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:50:51Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:50:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: ADR-conformance gaps from 2026-10-04 audit (#141)\n\n* fix: RepromiseOrder honours requiredShipBy via FeasibleBy (ADR 0020)\n\n* fix: retry version conflicts in-process then DLQ instead of silently skipping (ADR-0024)\n\n* fix: map inventory-storage infrastructure failures to 503 downstream-unavailable (ADR-0003)\n\n* fix: flip readiness and honour drain delay on shutdown; stop relay after all outbox writers (ADR-0025)\n\n* fix: Tier 1 OTel on reports/projector/mcp — telemetry.Setup and otelchi/otelchimetric (ADR-0009)\n\n* fix: add Network bucket to the promise-basis distribution end to end (ADR-0019/0020); record hold sweeper as accepted deferral\n\n* docs: regenerate REST API reference for downstream-unavailable 503 examples\n\n* refactor: lint cleanup on projector telemetry setup and downstream-unavailable tests\n\n* feat: housekeeping sweeper (idempotency_keys TTL 24h, published outbox retention 7d) + outbox-lag gauge; ADR-0032\n\n* docs: ADR doc-drift batch — partially-superseded banners, stale claims fixed in place, 0025/0026/0028/0029/0032/0033 indexed, new ADR-0033 for bootretry+writer tuning, ADR-0031 accepted-limitation note","tree":{"sha":"0d9cbcf69f819f4bf43c5386deee4838ff541af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/git/trees/0d9cbcf69f819f4bf43c5386deee4838ff541af7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/git/commits/85a448183c1fe36eaeb47ad5c403c67bbe5fee4d","verification":{"payload":"tree 0d9cbcf69f819f4bf43c5386deee4838ff541af7\nparent 8d460379b2ae01efde59597bbe7290658703a3a5\