-lint --enable-only + gocyclo report\nin the step summary, gated into docker-publish). Refactor every\npre-existing violation with zero behavior change: table-driven problem\ncatalogs, split wiring/relay/policy functions, named test helpers instead\nof t.Run closures. golangci-lint, go build/vet, go test ./... all green.","tree":{"sha":"5c12c4fdaaf70de6a90870d10bfb71b3c0a436bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/git/trees/5c12c4fdaaf70de6a90870d10bfb71b3c0a436bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/order-management/git/commits/271f878e231693b220281a93b20b713b2dc9a648","verification":{"payload":"tree 5c12c4fdaaf70de6a90870d10bfb71b3c0a436bb\nparent 8a1f27b28b0e58172aef3a2ea74eb588cb052420\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790560294 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790560294 -0300\n\nci(complexity): enforce gocyclo/gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif gate, refactor all violations (#109)\n\nEnable the five complexity linters in .golangci.yml (gocyclo 15, gocognit 20,\ncyclop 15 / package-average 10, funlen 80 lines/50 statements, nestif 5;\n_test.go exempt from funlen/gocyclo, web/ exempt from all five) and add a\ndedicated `complexity` CI job (golangci-lint --enable-only + gocyclo report\nin the step summary, gated into docker-publish). Refactor every\npre-existing violation with zero behavior change: table-driven problem\ncatalogs, split wiring/relay/policy functions, named test helpers instead\nof t.Run closures. golangci-lint, go build/vet, go test ./... all green.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqucgmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA2oQABEN17yJCFxHMYI/ZnitLiNb\nYzGsy5JiSDE2dZn1kgIfS5lN0NMwoZZXt/fR6MLg5f1ZoCJDv/0OwYMthURKGzj5\ngHSyxS2HAukQKjytRnkRh2I21o/m7mux14krjFr7tu0w1e0RkpELym2S3aZxJR3/\nZe3qHgwCf1extQhPIVWt492IOBDG7foHuhGgdIQfdH2Kt6f0Nak9PMQKStR3YTYY\nAvKAhZTtMs4utfdIR7i8HmN+cYndnWMJkdnhvLI4ndEp2wpNUEtIHzlBicmL5YrL\nvYjXvgZP3bsRSb5GAcw3GJOWAgr/QQ+A9FV88V1Y3NzjF