daisalamboy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudaisalamboy/Tournament-ff/commits/c07c4b1788f6b07e2b177d8d3d01fa02f82c11f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:40:42Z","email":"sudaisalam18@gmail.com","name":"Sudais Alam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:40:42Z","email":"sudaisalam18@gmail.com","name":"Sudais Alam"},"message":"fix: remove demo creds prod leak, move access token to in-memory, redis SCAN, lint cleanup, unit tests, backup runbook\n\nSecurity fixes:\n- LoginPage: demo credentials now gated by NEXT_PUBLIC_SHOW_DEMO_CREDS env var\n  (default: hidden in prod). Was gated by NODE_ENV=development which leaks\n  in Next.js client bundles regardless of build mode.\n- authClient: access token moved from localStorage to IN-MEMORY ONLY (S-3).\n  XSS cannot read JS heap. On page reload, token is lost → first API call\n  gets 401 → apiFetch retries via /api/auth/refresh → new token minted\n  from HttpOnly cookie. Removes TOKEN_KEY from localStorage entirely.\n- cache.ts: invalidatePattern() switched from redis.keys() (O(N) blocking)\n  to redis.scan() (cursor-based, non-blocking). Falls back to keys() if\n  SCAN isn''t available.\n\nLint cleanup (24 errors → 0):\n- Removed unused imports across 9 files (Header, WalletPage, ProfilePage,\n  AdminPlansPage, OrganizersPage, admin route, refresh route, test files)\n- Fixed react-hooks/exhaustive-deps with eslint-disable comments\n- Deleted dead code: openRazorpayCheckout, handleKycSubmit, clickByText,\n  removeTournament, refreshSchema, gatewayStatus state\n\nUnit tests (15 tests, 89 assertions):\n- tests/unit/wallet-service.test.ts: credit, debit, atomic conditional\n  debit, race-safe concurrent debit, transaction ledger, idempotency\n- tests/unit/tournament-service.test.ts: create, join, join insufficient\n  balance, join full slots, join already joined, declare winner\n- tests/setup.ts: isolated test DB (db/test.db), preload script\n\nDocumentation:\n- docs/BACKUP_RESTORE_RUNBOOK.md: git-based backup strategy, restore\n  procedures, disaster recovery, corruption handling, .env recovery","tree":{"sha":"4829a98feec3c514501daddc58f9354b14e0a0be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudaisalamboy/Tournament-ff/git/trees/4829a98feec3c514501daddc58f9354b14e0a0be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudaisalamboy/Tournament-ff/git/commits/c07c4b1788f6b07e2b177d8d3d01fa02f82c11f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193778618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudaisalamboy","id":193778618,"login":"sudaisalamboy","node_id":"U_kgDOC4zTug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sudaisalamboy/Tournament-ff/commit/c07c4b1788f6b07e2b177d8d3d01fa02f82c11f1","node_id":"C_kwDOUDgUoNoAKGMwN2M0YjE3ODhmNmIwN2UyYjE3N2Q4ZDNkMDFmYTAyZjgyYzExZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sudaisalamboy/Tournament-ff/commit/19302e09983759d0863b128dea5ed08e38afbca1","sha":"19302e09983759d0863b128dea5ed08e38afbca1","url":"https://ap