ader.tsx\n- Completely redesigned HomePage:\n  - Hero: animated gradient glows, grid pattern overlay, gradient-x text animation\n  - Trust indicators row (Secure Payments, Instant Withdrawals, 4.9/5 Rating)\n  - Stats bar: 4 stats (was 3) with gradient icon backgrounds\n  - Featured tournaments: hover lift effect, trophy icon on prize, uppercase labels\n  - New ''Why Choose Us'' features section (4 cards: Instant Payouts, Secure, Community, Organizer)\n  - How It Works: connecting line on desktop, gradient icon backgrounds, step badges\n  - CTA: dual buttons (Play Now + Get ₹10 Signup Bonus), background blur glows\n  - Responsible Gaming: added ''Real Money'' badge\n  - Footer: better mobile layout, logo icon box\n  - New animations: gradient-x, slide-down, card hover lift\n  - Fully responsive: mobile-first, sm/md/lg breakpoints throughout","tree":{"sha":"7381db0aa1a471938a9f6e697e6cfd033b041ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudaisalamboy/Tournament-ff/git/trees/7381db0aa1a471938a9f6e697e6cfd033b041ce8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudaisalamboy/Tournament-ff/git/commits/f6f8a0292c67d907182b5f34be5cc3bbfacaec91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193778618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudaisalamboy","id":193778618,"login":"sudaisalamboy","node_id":"U_kgDOC4zTug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudaisalamboy/repos","site_admin":false,"