3f6d5bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/62aef33e0e073689d756bae58558d008d3f6d5bf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/0482eca2c9875117c3c093877e115c4d86ce0d5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:37:39Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:37:39Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"chore: packaging, manifest and CI from the 1.0 review (phase 5)\n\n- Drop the dead nav block, list only page modules in exposes, and\n  require cms-framework ^2.12, PHP ^8.3 and ext-openssl.\n- Add a CI workflow (tests, typecheck, build) and run the tests before\n  building a release ZIP.\n- Remove the empty hook anchors, tag everything new in 1.0 as\n  @since 1.0.0, and correct the build script''s comments.","tree":{"sha":"a566aa95a0eca2eedfeed165fa621e8e1cce364c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/a566aa95a0eca2eedfeed165fa621e8e1cce364c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/0482eca2c9875117c3c093877e115c4d86ce0d5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/0482eca2c9875117c3c093877e115c4d86ce0d5d","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKDA0ODJlY2EyYzk4NzUxMTdjM2MwOTM4NzdlMTE1YzRkODZjZTBkNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/d69abc1a0b6feea2849b66ff645b7c6a1fae74db","sha":"d69abc1a0b6feea2849b66ff645b7c6a1fae74db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/d69abc1a0b6feea2849b66ff645b7c6a1fae74db"}],"sha":"0482eca2c9875117c3c093877e115c4d86ce0d5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/0482eca2c9875117c3c093877e115c4d86ce0d5d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/d69abc1a0b6feea2849b66ff645b7c6a1fae74db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:36:31Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:36:31Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"fix: frontend issues from the 1.0 review (phase 4)\n\n- Cache boards and stats client side for 60 s and keep Issues tab\n  filters per package; Refresh asks the server for a fresh read.\n- Treat redirects and HTML 2xx answers as errors in apiFetch, and map\n  401/419 to a session message.\n- Serialize optimistic card moves and keep them across reloads.\n- Keep keyboard focus on reorder, range and close/reopen buttons.\n- Prune saved board filters the board no longer offers.\n- Share the Packages list URL; reload it only if still there, and\n  abandon a sync run on unmount.\n- Guard docs import polling against stale and overlapping reads.\n- Fix the icon preview''s loading and invalid-value states.\n- Accessibility: persistent status regions, retry buttons, clearer\n  status select labels, copy-command block labels, and a confirm before\n  discarding issue edits.\n- Accept Inertia 2.x and 3.x from the host; silence the empty-chunk\n  warning.","tree":{"sha":"f2e47bc1dcae6f68ccce55466b884c0a9928133d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/f2e47bc1dcae6f68ccce55466b884c0a9928133d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/d69abc1a0b6feea2849b66ff645b7c6a1fae74db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/d69abc1a0b6feea2849b66ff645b7c6a1fae74db","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKGQ2OWFiYzFhMGI2ZmVlYTI4NDliNjZmZjY0NWI3YzZhMWZhZTc0ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/a3eebf7fef83ce60b06a00b3440fb082e10e13db","sha":"a3eebf7fef83ce60b06a00b3440fb082e10e13db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/a3eebf7fef83ce60b06a00b3440fb082e10e13db"}],"sha":"d69abc1a0b6feea2849b66ff645b7c6a1fae74db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/d69abc1a0b6feea2849b66ff645b7c6a1fae74db"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/a3eebf7fef83ce60b06a00b3440fb082e10e13db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:30:04Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:30:04Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"fix: backend correctness from the 1.0 review (phase 3)\n\n- Make the daily jobs unique and non-overlapping, lock docs imports\n  (409 while one runs), and make sync state and snapshot writes\n  race-safe.\n- Read undecryptable credentials as unset instead of throwing.\n- Show the newest comments of long threads, with the total.\n- Report a GraphQL primary rate limit with its real reset time.\n- Flag truncated boards in the UI and page through option lists.\n- Cache a provisioned marker instead of querying on every request.\n- Add the artisanpack-ui.settings.manage permission and move Settings\n  and its endpoints onto it.","tree":{"sha":"6653de0e79f280af29f47d2960147c0946f7c7af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/6653de0e79f280af29f47d2960147c0946f7c7af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/a3eebf7fef83ce60b06a00b3440fb082e10e13db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/a3eebf7fef83ce60b06a00b3440fb082e10e13db","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKGEzZWViZjdmZWY4M2NlNjBiMDZhMDBiMzQ0MGZiMDgyZTEwZTEzZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/99dc3899435fdb5a1dd292c4a3aeb1dd589866f7","sha":"99dc3899435fdb5a1dd292c4a3aeb1dd589866f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/99dc3899435fdb5a1dd292c4a3aeb1dd589866f7"}],"sha":"a3eebf7fef83ce60b06a00b3440fb082e10e13db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/a3eebf7fef83ce60b06a00b3440fb082e10e13db"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/99dc3899435fdb5a1dd292c4a3aeb1dd589866f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:25:47Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:25:47Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"fix: security hardening from the 1.0 review (phase 2)\n\n- Require the docs token / App private key again when the docs origin or\n  App/installation ID changes.\n- Restrict issue endpoints to issues on the org project (no PRs, no\n  other repos); list edit options only for repos on the board.\n- Resolve A/AAAA records, fail closed, block CGNAT/NAT64/IPv4-mapped\n  ranges and pin docs-site requests to the vetted address.\n- Render issue images as links and open links in a new tab.\n- Encrypt the cached installation token; flush GitHub caches when\n  settings change.\n- Remove the unused api-tokens.manage permission.\n- Purge credentials, cached token and icons when the plugin is deleted;\n  drop orphaned snapshots and sync state.\n- Split the release workflow so no write-scoped job runs npm.\n- Serve only known asset types, with nosniff.\n- Skip board cards from repos outside the org (3.3), cache board reads\n  for 45 s with a separate read throttle (4.1 server side) and flag\n  truncated boards (3.6 server side).","tree":{"sha":"5ce96c23b647c09d784c689504dd005eaa0fbb7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/5ce96c23b647c09d784c689504dd005eaa0fbb7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/99dc3899435fdb5a1dd292c4a3aeb1dd589866f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/99dc3899435fdb5a1dd292c4a3aeb1dd589866f7","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKDk5ZGMzODk5NDM1ZmRiNWExZGQyOTJjNGEzYWViMWRkNTg5ODY2Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/26a2c121cf12910b7e684f81b26f620c61710918","sha":"26a2c121cf12910b7e684f81b26f620c61710918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/26a2c121cf12910b7e684f81b26f620c61710918"}],"sha":"99dc3899435fdb5a1dd292c4a3aeb1dd589866f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/99dc3899435fdb5a1dd292c4a3aeb1dd589866f7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/26a2c121cf12910b7e684f81b26f620c61710918/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:16:20Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:16:20Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"fix: release blockers from the 1.0 review (phase 1)\n\n- Name every route before its verb so names resolve under a cached\n  route table; guard the shared Inertia prop against a missing name and\n  share it only on admin pages with plugin users.\n- Portal the issue modal and stop its forms'' submit events reaching the\n  host''s Edit Package form.\n- Send the XSRF-TOKEN cookie so plugin writes survive an Inertia login.\n- Bump the version to 1.0.0 and check package.json matches on release.","tree":{"sha":"bb6402f8c84c920b0f96ad9ffa3bc433edb5afe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/bb6402f8c84c920b0f96ad9ffa3bc433edb5afe0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/26a2c121cf12910b7e684f81b26f620c61710918","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/26a2c121cf12910b7e684f81b26f620c61710918","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKDI2YTJjMTIxY2YxMjkxMGI3ZTY4NGY4MWIyNmY2MjBjNjE3MTA5MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/1d1757d75fe9bc5a31ab7422874f437b14a9010f","sha":"1d1757d75fe9bc5a31ab7422874f437b14a9010f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/1d1757d75fe9bc5a31ab7422874f437b14a9010f"}],"sha":"26a2c121cf12910b7e684f81b26f620c61710918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/26a2c121cf12910b7e684f81b26f620c61710918"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ