":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/81915d3c687d13d15ef9158c45a43965111ea160"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/1baf0f01e9997126af8b1fa493150f57d0bd8cbe","sha":"1baf0f01e9997126af8b1fa493150f57d0bd8cbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/1baf0f01e9997126af8b1fa493150f57d0bd8cbe"}],"sha":"1d1757d75fe9bc5a31ab7422874f437b14a9010f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/1d1757d75fe9bc5a31ab7422874f437b14a9010f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/1baf0f01e9997126af8b1fa493150f57d0bd8cbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:50:35Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:50:35Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"feat: add kanban dashboard widget\n\nAdd a \"Packages board\" dashboard widget (roadmap 5.5) showing issue\ncounts per Status column on the org project, for every package or the\nones picked in its settings, with a link to the global board filtered to\nthe same packages.\n\nBoardSummary counts every card per Status option and package once and\ncaches the result for 60 seconds, so dashboard loads don''t page through\nthe project each time; the boards themselves stay live. GitHub and\nsettings failures come back as a message the widget shows. The widget is\ngated on artisanpack-ui.issues.manage, the permission the board needs.\n\nThe global board applies a ?packages= link in place of the saved\nfilters, then drops the parameter so a reload keeps later changes.\n\nCloses #22","tree":{"sha":"5042e6914dc0dcd93b2a78b10eb6ccf88154dd7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/5042e6914dc0dcd93b2a78b10eb6ccf88154dd7a"