s, kanban boards and issue modal (#17–#21)","tree":{"sha":"3e66f4210e51e310b156f31df3f2ea1abebb5f47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/3e66f4210e51e310b156f31df3f2ea1abebb5f47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/3ed6d2109615e620ecaf665e135402a07c35d829","verification":{"payload":"tree 3e66f4210e51e310b156f31df3f2ea1abebb5f47\nparent fd8a448debb98ca5e91dec873482fcb462d9aba8\nparent e9567196e9c9319888d02f8e41a58fc4d7dd98a9\nauthor Jacob Martella <me@jacobmartella.com> 1791421222 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791421222 -0500\n\nMerge pull request #30 from ArtisanPack-UI/enhancement/17-21-stats-widgets-and-kanban-boards\n\nfeat: dashboard stats widgets, kanban boards and issue modal (#17–#21)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxusmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz2IQABQ/Ne3/4jOnmCe6Z+rKfJ9W\n8VZTAzcxyBWxuYmGeh7jMaeiDcgsCTYDmaqcd+/HEP8H95pyIW8T6ORvq67qX+iV\nSIMAJKZ0vqp73DZsWBzOwAJvu8dYN0RWA/xp7W5arTRlYLe0jIvNXWSVEb8Sj8uy\nVLRYxPugA2w/n20rUGr5wQ7Fqh1v6lqR0ut0aM0/lxZ1eKVq3zJCudqb88c/pTXT\ngCaY3KB5ziIhxKwRTkgRJH/IdbiYNkDvJBLll/OiqL72QdFnkWFd0vBTybJJNNXq\n4MROQEdpXt7SuABo63fwFOVjWwJOi7gMbQ/y6fCvk524zwHviXPYq/eE+ullGsWq\nw9NlMevDr2iW5NN0UMMPwdSL/eqeOX7u3ye+vlZewAH9AXkSczyEzFUwxgHbe7Ww\nGS7mL63cvty9roA5xke/VwlvHcagE5jEUqjmoKEVOMyK3gLJ+3d28FoODvpZJAzI\ntN2E/DktERoA3lPhFK6kn1eaTPrqo8CCGDBNzzHN0TSuzYqomUaszx2oJdV9mPL6\nfEXblRV9osMJs9V8SOVcld7U2ybLKSB28K4Dw+V/wQWTwZzwuTE5kCgC3nn+wyAc\neKVJWrCovU0aWeH5MlYCD1cslkrOqLyiTSyPROtTesMDjewuFAPUJCq1ac/gZK1e\n++1g3dwKdh2CDC/Mfk72\n=ESin\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T01:00:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/3ed6d2109615e620ecaf665e135402a07c35d829","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKDNlZDZkMjEwOTYxNWU2MjBlY2FmNjY1ZTEzNTQwMmEwN2MzNWQ4Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/fd8a448debb98ca5e91dec873482fcb462d9aba8","sha":"fd8a448debb98ca5e91dec873482fcb462d9aba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/fd8a448debb98ca5e91dec873482fcb462d9aba8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/e9567196e9c9319888d02f8e41a58fc4d7dd98a9","sha":"e9567196e9c9319888d02f8e41a58fc4d7dd98a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/e9567196e9c9319888d02f8e41a58fc4d7dd98a9"}],"sha":"3ed6d2109615e620ecaf665e135402a07c35d829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/3ed6d2109615e620ecaf665e135402a07c35d829"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/e9567196e9c9319888d02f8e41a58fc4d7dd98a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:58:02Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:58:02Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"feat: dashboard stats widgets, org project kanban boards and issue modal (#17–#21)\n\nDashboard widgets (#17): five widgets registered with AdminWidgetManager\nand rendered from the federated bundle via registerFederated: downloads\nKPI (total/monthly/daily, all packages or one), downloads trend with a\npackage selector, GitHub overview, top packages by downloads gained or\ngrowth over a window, and a release feed. All gated on\nartisanpack-ui.stats.view and read from the daily snapshots, so a\ndashboard load never calls GitHub or the registries.\n\nProject reader (#18): a paginated GraphQL reader for the org Project v2\nreturning a normalized board (Status columns plus issue items), mapping\neach repo to its package via github_repo. PRs, drafts and archived items\nare skipped; the Status field ids are cached for moves.\n\nPackage board (#19): the Edit Package Issues tab shows the board scoped\nto the package''s repo, with milestone and label filters. Cards move by\ndrag and drop or a per-card Status select via\nupdateProjectV2ItemFieldValue (or clear for \"No status\"), optimistically\nwith rollback.\n\nIssue modal (#20): view an issue with server-rendered, HTML-escaped\nmarkdown and its comments; edit title, body, labels, milestone and\nassignees; close/reopen; add comments. Writes are attributed to the\nGitHub App, which the modal states.\n\nGlobal board (#21): the plugin landing page shows every package with a\ngroup-by-package swimlane toggle, sorting, package/milestone/label\nfilters persisted per user in localStorage, reusing the board and modal.\n\nAll board and issue endpoints require artisanpack-ui.issues.manage, are\nrate limited, and are confined to repos in the configured org.\n\nCloses #17\nCloses #18\nCloses #19\nCloses #20\nCloses #21","tree":{"sha":"3e66f4210e51e310b156f31df3f2ea1abebb5f47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/3e66f4210e51e310b156f31df3f2ea1abebb5f47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/e9567196e9c9319888d02f8e41a58fc4d7dd98a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/e9567196e9c9319888d02f8e41a58fc4d7dd98a9","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKGU5NTY3MTk2ZTljOTMxOTg4OGQwMmY4ZTQxYTU4ZmM0ZDdkZDk4YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/fd8a448debb98ca5e91dec873482fcb462d9aba8","sha":"fd8a448debb98ca5e91dec873482fcb462d9aba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/fd8a448debb98ca5e91dec873482fcb462d9aba8"}],"sha":"e9567196e9c9319888d02f8e41a58fc4d7dd98a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/e9567196e9c9319888d02f8e41a58fc4d7dd98a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.git