ugin/commits/5cee58c585329a21ac7d9d7a168d4ce21b39fe58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:34:42Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:39:14Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"feat: icon picker, apui icon set and package sync from docs (#7–#11)\n\n- icon_picker custom field type for the package `icon` field, with a\n  picker on Edit Package whose catalog lists every set IconSvgResolver\n  serves; existing `icon` rows are retyped on boot (#7)\n- `apui` icon set in plugin storage, registered via\n  ap.icons.registerIconSets; SVGs are sanitized before they are stored and\n  DOCTYPE/entity declarations are refused (#8)\n- \"Sync from docs\" on the Packages list: imports new docs packages as\n  drafts matched by docs_package_id, then registry name, never\n  overwriting title/body (#9)\n- version sync from Packagist/npm with GitHub release fallback, run in\n  batches, PATCHing the docs site when it differs (#10)\n- icon sync from the docs site into iconRefs and the apui set, keeping\n  manually chosen icons (#11)\n- Registry select on Edit Package; visual-editor and icons as dev deps\n\nCloses #7\nCloses #8\nCloses #9\nCloses #10\nCloses #11","tree":{"sha":"6420daa644f14c7ca9d3965a0e64a16b49f429bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/6420daa644f14c7ca9d3965a0e64a16b49f429bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/5cee58c585329a21ac7d9d7a168d4ce21b39fe58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/5cee58c585329a21ac7d9d7a168d4ce21b39fe58","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKDVjZWU1OGM1ODUzMjlhMjFhYzdkOWQ3YTE2OGQ0Y2UyMWIzOWZlNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-