"date":"2026-10-06T21:20:52Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:20:52Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"feat: scaffold federated admin module and spike Keystone extension points\n\nGive the plugin its own Module Federation remote, mirroring keystone-sync,\nand replace the Inertia render of the nonexistent admin/artisanpack-ui/Index\npage.\n\n- Vite federation build to dist/assets/remoteEntry.js sharing React,\n  Inertia and hooks-js with the host; federated_module declared in\n  plugin.json and registered imperatively with the absolute asset URL.\n- Public asset route with realpath containment serving dist/assets.\n- Placeholder packages-board (/admin/artisanpack-ui) and settings\n  (/admin/artisanpack-ui/settings) pages.\n- ./boot module that adds Docs, Stats and Issues tabs to the package edit\n  screen through keystone.admin.panels.entries / .resolved.\n- Spike findings recorded in plans/roadmap.md: tabs yes (client side),\n  custom field editors no on dynamic types, dashboard widgets yes.\n- ArtisanPack UI logo as the admin sidebar icon via a plugin icon set.\n- Release ZIP script and tag-triggered GitHub workflow that attach the\n  built ZIP and sha256 sidecar to the release for Keystone''s updater.\n\nCloses #1","tree":{"sha":"de267c1b26c988fd228b864a334c041024f4f56e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/de267c1b26c988fd228b864a334c041024f4f56e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/81153ed1a330e85fd4f93476e1dbdfead6ba5b99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/81153ed1a330e85fd4f93476e1dbdfead6ba5b99","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKDgxMTUzZWQxYTMzMGU4NWZkNGY5MzQ3NmUxZGJkZmVhZDZiYTViOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/d46e976d38c36e13dfbf0bb6f46a3605f7106917","sha":"d46e976d38c36e13dfbf0bb6f46a3605f7106917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/d46e976d38c36e13dfbf0bb6f46a3605f7106917"}],"sha":"81153ed1a330e85fd4f93476e1dbdfead6ba5b99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/81153ed1a330e85fd4f93476e1dbdfead6ba5b99"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/d46e976d38c36e13dfbf0bb6f46a3605f7106917/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:59:53Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:59:53Z","email":"viewfromthebox94@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"Add plugin roadmap\n\nPlan for the package admin hub: docs-site sync, icon picker + custom\nicon set, Packagist/npm/GitHub stats and dashboard widgets, org Project\nkanban boards, and the JMWD Command Center read API. Tracked as issues\n#1–#25 here and ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-docs#188–#193.","tree":{"sha":"efb79c679b907a6ec0f5b8bbf931bba202b45ff7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/efb79c679b907a6ec0f5b8bbf931bba202b45ff7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/d46e976d38c36e13dfbf0bb6f46a3605f7106917","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/d46e976d38c36e13dfbf0bb6f46a3605f7106917","node_id":"C_kwDOUEQ9j9oAKGQ0NmU5NzZkMzhjMzZlMTNkZmJmMGJiNmY0NmEzNjA1ZjcxMDY5MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commit/234578eadefeafcf699b5989