:{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/commits/7984f694e495f624bfc36fe4c83625cb979fbef3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:57:13Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:57:13Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"Add package CPT + terminal / copy-command blocks\n\nRegisters the `package` ContentType via a seeder that runs the same\ntwo-phase provision-and-claim flow the Content Model admin does\n(insert into content_types, claim in keystone_content_type_tables,\nSchema::create the dedicated `packages` records table).\n\nShips two server-rendered visual editor blocks — `artisanpack/terminal`\n(chrome-style + prefix-driven typed lines) and `artisanpack/copy-command`\n(bordered pill with click-to-copy button) — via\n`VisualEditor::registerServerBlock` so the editor synthesizes the edit UI\nfrom the attribute schemas, no client bundle rebuild required. Both\nrender through blade partials under `site::blocks.*`.\n\nThe Package Eloquent model hard-codes its table to `packages` and uses\n`HasBlockContent` directly, working around the documented never-firing\n`KeystoneResourceResolver` extender in Keystone (filed as Keystone#369)\nthat would otherwise leave the model''s table unset and 500 the editor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015uwhyaU2yu8pWuw3vSF25V","tree":{"sha":"efb53690cd26c8f2914f376a639a1158ad225cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/trees/efb53690cd26c8f2914f376a639a1158ad225cd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/artisanpack-ui-website-plugin/git/commits/7984f694e495f624bfc36fe4c83625cb979fbef3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/