https://api.github.com/users/vivaanwarrier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivaanwarrier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivaanwarrier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivaanwarrier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivaanwarrier/chronoglow/commits/647b43b5565b5a952b737e91d6bd9c1b1840034c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T23:50:56Z","email":"vivaanwarrier1@gmail.com","name":"Vivaan Warrier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T23:50:56Z","email":"vivaanwarrier1@gmail.com","name":"Vivaan Warrier"},"message":"Add gesture recognition, action mapping, and calibration panel\n\nMediaPipe HandLandmarker wiring (src/handTracking.js) driven by a pure,\nunit-tested classifier (src/gestureClassifier.js: fist, open palm, swipe\nleft/right, pinch, hold-open-palm-to-reset). gestureController.js maps\nclassified gestures to shared-state changes per the vocabulary table.\nThreshold config (src/thresholds.js) is bounded min/max, exposed via a\ncalibration panel, ready for the future Gesture Calibration Agent to tune.\nTelemetry module tracks classification log, override history, and system\nhealth stats for the benchmarking suite and future agents.\n\nVerified: 9/9 unit tests pass on synthetic landmark sequences (also caught\nand fixed a real bug -- swipe cooldown seeded at 0 instead of -Infinity,\nwhich collided with performance.now() timestamps near page load). In\nbrowser: MediaPipe model loads and runs successfully; camera-permission\ndenial is handled gracefully with correct UI state (was buggy, fixed).","tree":{"sha":"6b75baf7950691c2c1f7963ac2cb0fc8afcf60be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivaanwarrier/chronoglow/git/trees/6b75baf7950691c2c1f7963ac2cb0fc8afcf60be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivaanwarrier/chronoglow/git/commits/647b43b5565b5a952b737e91d6bd9c1b1840034c","verification":{