pi.github.com/repos/raine-works/bun-1-4-monorepo/commits/c32528f975b6045548dea9a96d4d5dec50a5ebf3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T20:39:50Z","email":"raine@raineworks.com","name":"Raine Petersen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T20:39:50Z","email":"raine@raineworks.com","name":"Raine Petersen"},"message":"feat(tools,ui): introduce @app/tools and @app/ui shared workspace\npackages\n\n    - Create `@app/tools` package consolidating frontend build scripts,\n      CLI formatting, scoped env parsing, HTTP/MIME headers, and SQL\n      migration helpers\n    - Create `@app/ui` package providing shared UI components (`Badge`,\n      `Button`, `Card`, `TelemetryBadge`), layout blocks (`MfeLayout`,\n      `MfeHeader`, `MfeFooter`, `GlobalMfeNav`, `NotFoundView`), and\n      hooks/utils (`useIsMobile`, `cn`)\n    - Refactor `@app/hub`, `@app/store`, and `@app/docs` to delegate\n      build scripts to `@app/tools/build` and replace duplicated\n      root/404 UI boilerplate with `@app/ui`\n    - Refactor `@app/backend` and `@app/data` to reuse shared HTTP\n      utilities, SQL parsing, and environment schemas from `@app/tools`\n    - Configure workspace path aliases (`@tools/*`, `@ui/*`) in root and\n      package `tsconfig.json` files and document guidelines in\n      AGENTS.md/GEMINI.md\n    - Colocate unit test suites in `packages/tools` and `packages/ui`\n      (95 passing monorepo tests total)","tree":{"sha":"f04d49ce9ab98733f40406409e1c92de589c6068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raine-works/bun-1-4-monorepo/git/trees/f04d49ce9ab98733f40406409e1c92de589c6068"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raine-works/bun-1-4-monorepo/git/commits/c32528f975b6045548dea9a96d4d5dec50a5ebf3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49534559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raine-works/events{/privacy}","