://api.github.com/users/raine-works/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raine-works/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raine-works/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raine-works/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raine-works/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raine-works","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raine-works/bun-1-4-monorepo/commits/9d4b2b7c43d4e93777a65cb22bd012668aa60cc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T19:49:06Z","email":"raine@raineworks.com","name":"Raine Petersen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T19:49:06Z","email":"raine@raineworks.com","name":"Raine Petersen"},"message":"feat(backend,data): implement graceful shutdown, transaction draining,\nand connection flushing\n\n    - Add active transaction tracking to Database client in @app/data\n    - Implement waitForTransactions, flush, close, and shutdown methods\n      on Database\n    - Add singleton helpers (waitForDbTransactions, flushDatabase,\n      shutdownDatabase, isDbClosing)\n    - Reject incoming SQL transactions when database is marked as\n      closing\n    - Implement GracefulShutdownHandler in @app/backend to trap OS\n      signals (SIGINT, SIGTERM, SIGQUIT)\n    - Drain in-flight HTTP requests, terminate live reload SSE streams,\n      and flush database connections cleanly\n    - Update /api/health to return 503 shutting_down and /api/info with\n      isShuttingDown flag during teardown\n    - Attach server.shutdown() method to createServer and auto-register\n      signal handlers in non-test environments\n    - Add dev:init and docker:run convenience scripts in package.json\n      and docker/compose.yaml\n    - Add comprehensive test suites for graceful shutdown and\n      transaction lifecycle draining (73 passing tests)","tree":{"sha":"91060dd980d22079032c216f8ccec4