rred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raine-works/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raine-works","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raine-works/bun-1-4-monorepo/commits/deace4629bc9855bae3befb1b934633d135d9781/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T06:57:44Z","email":"raine@raineworks.com","name":"Raine Petersen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T06:57:44Z","email":"raine@raineworks.com","name":"Raine Petersen"},"message":"perf: optimize mobile and desktop Lighthouse scores to 100\n\n    - Add dynamic HTTP Gzip compression middleware (`Bun.gzipSync`) for\n      text, JS, CSS,\n      JSON, and SVG responses with `Vary: Accept-Encoding`.\n    - Implement immutable 1-year caching (`max-age=31536000, immutable`)\n      for hashed\n      chunks and standard headers for static assets in `mfe.ts`.\n    - Add security headers (`X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`,\n      `X-Frame-Options:\n      SAMEORIGIN`, `Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin`).\n    - Enable route-level code splitting (`lazyRouteComponent`) across\n      Hub, Store, and\n      Docs TanStack routers.\n    - Update `build.ts` scripts with production target browser, code\n      splitting, dead-\n      code elimination define flags, and minification.\n    - Upgrade color contrast across all routes to WCAG AA compliant\n      palette (`text-\n      slate-200/300/400`, `text-emerald-300`, `text-sky-300`).\n    - Ensure accessible touch targets (`min-h-[36px]`), explicit\n      `aria-label`s, and\n      form labels.\n    - Add descriptive meta description, theme-color, robots directives,\n      SVG favicons,\n      and critical inline base CSS in HTML entrypoints.","tree":{"sha":"1a3404da6f4dc423b483f57424f8af0a4bc2285b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raine-works/bun-1-4-monorepo/git/trees/1a3404da6f4dc423b483f57424f8af0a4bc2285b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rai