l":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/commits/6dc856cac7da11473009e9e3ded07fe710f99430/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:40:31Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:40:31Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"message":"feat(nip): wire network-inventory-planning — DB, ArgoCD app, Kong route, transfer consumer\n\nRegister the NIP bounded context the way network-fulfillment is registered\n(dedicated terraform/network-inventory-planning.tf, NOT local.services —\nNIP''s Dockerfile/chart land in a parallel PR there, and service_source_hash\nwould fail validate against a missing Dockerfile):\n\n- Postgres role/database network_inventory_planning (generated password,\n  never committed; merged into the initdb template and PgBouncer''s\n  pgbouncer_oltp_services exactly like network-fulfillment''s) plus the\n  network-inventory-planning-db Secret (DATABASE_URL + direct-Postgres\n  MIGRATIONS_DATABASE_URL counterpart).\n- ArgoCD Application network-inventory-planning -> IQVO/network-inventory-planning\n  charts/network-inventory-planning (chart lands in that repo''s parallel\n  PR; the Application sits MissingSource-degraded until then — noted).\n- Kong route /network-inventory-planning via the chart''s\n  ingress/gatewayApi blocks (same never-both ternary shape as every\n  sibling; gatewayApi while deploy_gateway_api=true).\n- inventory-storage TRANSFER_ALLOCATION_CONSUMER_MODE=kafka +\n  TRANSFER_ALLOCATION_CONSUMER_GROUP (chart-native config keys, ADR-0030;\n  never extraEnv — that duplicates env and breaks ArgoCD''s three-way diff)\n  consuming warehouse.network-inventory-planning.events.\n- Kafka topics warehouse.network-inventory-planning.{events,analytics}:\n  no declaration in this repo is the fleet norm — topics are auto-created\n  by their first writer under the broker''s num.partitions=8 /\n  rf=1 overrides (kafka.tf), so kafka.tf is untouched by design.\n- wes-work-planning needs NO env: PR #150 hardcodes the topic constant on\n  the existing inbound consumer group. fulfillment-execution verified: no\n  NIP/TRANSFER env exists in its chart — nothing to wire.\n\nNo terraform apply, no cluster mutation. terraform fmt + validate and\nmake check (tf + helm lint all 11 charts + shellcheck + selector check)\nall green.","tree":{"sha":"f993aba15a87b3a85027fe43d540168723d0afcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/trees/f993aba15a87b3a85027fe43d540168723d0afcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/commits/6dc856cac7da11473009e9e3ded07fe710f99430","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.git