:{"date":"2026-09-26T14:07:30Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T14:07:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(plans): correct stale ArgoCD rollout status to DONE (#37)\n\nFan-out to all 8 services and the helm_release.service state removal\nshipped in #25 (commit e138aee); argocd-apps.tf''s kubectl_manifest.application\nnow covers the full local.services set. Also marks the ops-agent/console\nscope open question resolved per #26.","tree":{"sha":"2cec1a306265819f4d96af682b6457f85747a66e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/trees/2cec1a306265819f4d96af682b6457f85747a66e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/commits/1955636881010c1067d7d61aee3fff38efb26414","verification":{"payload":"tree 2cec1a306265819f4d96af682b6457f85747a66e\nparent ea23994e6efd86093a568de92f74155bfcd563af\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790431650 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790431650 -0300\n\ndocs(plans): correct stale ArgoCD rollout status to DONE (#37)\n\nFan-out to all 8 services and the helm_release.service state removal\nshipped in #25 (commit e138aee); argocd-apps.tf''s kubectl_manifest.application\nnow covers the full local.services set. Also marks the ops-agent/console\nscope open question resolved per #26.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt9GiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHgUQAKf1ZSjD+Bi5LaESxw9AnMUt\nIDmBZ+gco2z3tB8s+QT96J21BKMRgjgmGngCiGbi3kwtyrhkfvFcijfv3ZB6Y+rF\nWvA0Is0IuNUOE4DxWZVkdhBLvk7t6LY7FEiNpJ6ihQDGXtFwZhaFqxyZzttpi8uf\nXQatUGUt96LQXQFKZvJC6+c2aLcFGZH/yHwdqqdZMeHar988870dwNrBjLV3g1c2\nxgJR+SqtER8TSjBWFTdHqCRKna/oz+OFIH8YC6PlxX4AFmS9HSR7EVUWxW9lWtOM\n/rbpZ63vNUIjsz/aff8dRspuKEjPg/6V5p/68U7bpQ3JmVGsZdgdpPGwYcdbUfej\nf8GLnbSvaJYWwlNYXCuFVSJ+olMFgAjb3nMqq7Mw0fCxxYYgTwmlqLw9ednXUn5I\nPWkodWFfH+4B9v433A/LsN5ebFS5nhe0cj+U8DMezREMM