715","node_id":"C_kwDOUEmPD9oAKGUxMzhhZWVkZDc3ZGYyMmVmNzVlMTJmZDI2OTJlNzhlMjFlYzk3MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/warehouse-infra/commit/9dcf84f7ac2c9b9955a96a26f1e4c90fe6276e4e","sha":"9dcf84f7ac2c9b9955a96a26f1e4c90fe6276e4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/commits/9dcf84f7ac2c9b9955a96a26f1e4c90fe6276e4e"}],"sha":"e138aeedd77df22ef75e12fd2692e78e21ec9715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/commits/e138aeedd77df22ef75e12fd2692e78e21ec9715"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/commits/9dcf84f7ac2c9b9955a96a26f1e4c90fe6276e4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:59:59Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:59:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(wes-work-planning): wire TRAVEL_DISTANCE_MODE/FACILITY_LAYOUT_BASE_URL (#24)\n\nwes-work-planning''s CommitShiftPlan gained an optional outbound\nTravelDistanceLookup (facility-layout ADR-0017, Phase B3 follow-on),\nmirroring the existing PRODUCT_CLASSIFICATION_MODE pattern. This\ncluster runs every supplier deployed, so — same reasoning as every\nother sync_edge_env entry — set TRAVEL_DISTANCE_MODE=http and point\nFACILITY_LAYOUT_BASE_URL at the in-cluster facility-layout Service\nrather than leave the binary''s permissive default silently no-op.\n\nSee wes-work-planning docs/docs/adr/0017-travel-distance-lookup-on-commit-shift-plan.md.","tree":{"sha":"1cd0c050a2964e2bd3ddacc1e9593a59fb8fdd60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/trees/1cd0c050a2964e2bd3ddacc1e9593a59fb8fdd60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/commits/9dcf84f7ac2c9b9955a96a26f1e4c90fe6276e4e","verification":{"payload":"tree 1cd0c050a2964e2bd3ddacc1e9593a59fb8fdd60\nparent 86778792c64e001048f928ba049203dbf718fa89\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1789250399 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789250399 -0300\n\nfeat(wes-work-planning): wire TRAVEL_DISTANCE_MODE/FACILITY_LAYOUT_BASE_URL (#24)\n\nwes-work-planning''s CommitShiftPlan gained an optional outbound\nTravelDistanceLookup (facility-layout ADR-0017, Phase B3 follow-on),\nmirroring the existing PRODUCT_CLASSIFICATION_MODE pattern. This\ncluster runs every supplier deployed, so — same reasoning as every\nother sync_edge_env entry — set TRAVEL_DISTANCE_MODE=http and point\nFACILITY_LAYOUT_BASE_URL at the in-cluster facility-layout Service\nrather than leave the binary''s permissive default silently no-op.\n\nSee wes-work-planning docs/docs/adr/0017-travel-distance-lookup-on-commit-shift-plan.md.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpctfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnoIQAH3s2FCyriqo494KiGsH9Tz+\n8EwtKW1RA3YPy/Sev3wE4L/UU0ZSxZxKU7NfSXBQfezjwz50/0L0Q+6S3MCTONy9\nPrrvctZw7w4CHXRFj19LRK2xHa3npm5N7GUwZR0d1ohb781MdVHp69nb0XOgIVOZ\nH+3d9GsLkiphJ822n4WwMZTQ/x5l/45SDa5eVsg/sops0TZjKkLU0