c","sha":"262e75864625012003737985e81295fdf6408c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/commits/262e75864625012003737985e81295fdf6408c8c"}],"sha":"0bfcecb6c07a1b79ffcd10233ffd617f5a107c2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/commits/0bfcecb6c07a1b79ffcd10233ffd617f5a107c2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/commits/262e75864625012003737985e81295fdf6408c8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T18:04:03Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T18:04:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(terraform): remove MCP static-bearer auth wiring (fleet-wide auth removal) (#16)\n\nThe 9 backend service repos removed REST/MCP static-bearer auth\nfleet-wide; their MCP servers are now unauthenticated. Remove the\nnow-dead key generation and wiring on the infra side:\n\n- terraform/mcp.tf: drop random_password.mcp_read_key /\n  mcp_readwrite_key. Keep local.mcp_services / local.mcp_endpoint\n  (still gate whether the MCP server is deployed via\n  var.deploy_mcp_servers, a separate concern from auth).\n- terraform/services.tf: per-service mcp block now only sets\n  enabled = var.deploy_mcp_servers (drop readKey/readWriteKey).\n- terraform/ops-agent.tf: drop the credentials block\n  (*ReadKey values); keep upstreams.*.endpoint (ops-agent still\n  needs to know where the MCP servers live, just no key to call\n  them). Matches warehouse-ops-agent''s own chart on origin/develop,\n  which no longer declares those credentials fields.\n\nterraform fmt -recursive and terraform validate both pass.","tree":{"sha":"cfe0c823fadf1311d6f95bb3fc96084dfda36197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/trees/cfe0c823fadf1311d6f95bb3fc96084dfda36197"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/commits/262e75864625012003737985e81295fdf6408c8c","verification":{"payload":"tree cfe0c823fadf1311d6f95bb3fc96084dfda36197\nparent cdd6cc5b112979c01f0970915092f003ed6e9fed\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1788977043 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788977043 -0300\n\nchore(terraform): remove MCP static-bearer auth wiring (fleet-wide auth removal) (#16)\n\nThe 9 backend service repos removed REST/MCP static-bearer auth\nfleet-wide; their MCP servers are now unauthenticated. Remove the\nnow-dead key generation and wiring on the infra side:\n\n- terraform/mcp.tf: drop random_password.mcp_read_key /\n  mcp_readwrite_key. Keep local.mcp_services / local.mcp_endpoint\n  (still gate whether the MCP server is deployed via\n  var.deploy_mcp_servers, a separate concern from auth).\n- terraform/services.tf: per-service mcp block now only sets\n  enabled = var.deploy_mcp_servers (drop readKey/readWriteKey).\n- terraform/ops-agent.tf: drop the credentials block\n  (*ReadKey values); keep upstreams.*.endpoint (ops-agent still\n  needs to know where the MCP servers live, just no key to call\n  them). Matches warehouse-ops-agent''s own chart on origin/develop,\n  which no longer declares those credentials fields.\n\nterraform fmt -recursive and terraform validate both pass.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoZ+TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwVcQAJklOdCP5j3IYRx0yY+NZJXD\n63zkTn4DUhc9yXWWRxGfVC/Ij7/scmfZCqHpqYONaFlSMcPogPQ20Fz7RD0k7EIX\n+773bJqyo5nayVXX2n5zZtwSp8AsXIBBJz3aWmTi+5pzglrYY6hg5xRBwlMtbrtW\npdKJ1V/Dp/2Q0y00/iUHK9FSFahlgiYZsCd/b24GVHbk1faDKhxtym/Ww6R7L4Dr\nHyfdZbF+5qT0BukFaS9G57PwlzW8AU17rf0iVm3fxRsegmtKmLOZvv7NM+yJF0dz\nX90xUi6yeIG9Pu4/eSLVbbg033grJEGQGvr8ivoGyVJ86y7J48b8WxN4VeCnAqA6\nmfT/0VNbIb1tHkDpy9kN0ojOG1V/EHgboyh+veJzNaptNGA5feDxO3tO6vMP8mMP\nL1c1RnLSPm989zyuG1RCsB4HGODu2iR76Fz+bTQXrHiTqz+3V1sAkwkK6Cw/zOpB\nDvYcB6Z3ahdZIUIFI9tBESsmYbasZHgWxT5pHpyS0uoDhzp3OClODM0ZsfyqpQfU\nAYgUfEr0h68P16Ns3Ryp/clJXVmRg7vIaEUTmhShV54c2jNQzPTVYn84Dc3Szgqc\nnXOG/5ebyG9ZpBnZv/a3KjyxqJKA6dSRqnXNMkuMDvY9cFs5a7bWlV/2fo9kqhgi\n18ZUjJ1tczpIcP/cHaJ+\n=xG75\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T18:04:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https:/