rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/commits/13a08bd1ae5bc2ba99804603a476e70ce48c062a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T09:47:07Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T09:47:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: add matchPrefix to the process-path catalogue schema (#3)\n\nCompanion fix to fulfillment-execution''s Catalogue.Lookup regression:\nthe original id field alone was being used as an exact-match key, but\nno real path_id in this fleet is ever the bare canonical id (real\nproducers use forms like ''pick'', ''pick-zone-a'', ''pick-soak''). Each\ndeclared path now also carries matchPrefix, the lower-case family\nprefix every consuming service''s Catalogue.Lookup matches against\n(exact match on the prefix, or prefix + ''-'' as a separator).","tree":{"sha":"f46f461829ef3edaf5ae0bc4db34ea1f5d377881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/trees/f46f461829ef3edaf5ae0bc4db34ea1f5d377881"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-infra/git/commits/13a08bd1ae5bc2ba99804603a476e70ce48c062a","verification":{"payload":"tree f46f461829ef3edaf5ae0bc4db34ea1f5d377881\nparent 1196c78a598cba0315536e29d470c7a39f9f1a6a\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1788515227 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788515227 -0300\n\nfix: add matchPrefix to the process-path catalogue schema (#3)\n\nCompanion 