cek Wojarski"},"message":"feat: scaffold pnpm monorepo with Native Federation shell + 3 remotes\n\nSet up the workspace foundation (milestone 1/7):\n\n- pnpm workspace with 4 independently-buildable Angular 22 apps (shell,\n  mfe-fleet, mfe-diagnostics, mfe-security), zoneless + standalone, wired\n  together via @angular-architects/native-federation\n- shared design-tokens SCSS package consumed at build time by every app,\n  with runtime CSS custom properties owned by the shell\n- shared-types package with the full domain model (Device, Telemetry,\n  Alert/AlertRule, User/Session, diagnostics, WS/MQTT event payloads)\n- docker-compose.yml for postgres, redis and a custom Aedes mqtt-broker\n  service (own Dockerfile, multi-stage pnpm deploy build)\n- root README with architecture diagram, tech stack, port map and a\n  milestone checklist\n\nVerified: all 4 apps build and pass their Vitest unit tests; the shell\nsuccessfully loads each remote''s manifest/remoteEntry over CORS; the\nmqtt-broker container passes a real pub/sub round trip both directly and\nthrough docker compose.","tree":{"sha":"2a72277ca687ac4ffad0212dc7eaf3a3c22b1b6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JacekWoj16/edge-fleet-monitor/git/trees/2a72277ca687ac4ffad0212dc7eaf3a3c22b1b6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JacekWoj16/edge-fleet-monitor/git/commits/f09c02cf17568494891454ffaef04a3aa1b5dd9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209637031?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JacekWoj16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JacekWoj16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JacekWoj16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JacekWoj16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JacekWoj16","id":209637031,"login":"JacekWoj16","node_id":"U_kgDODH7Opw","organizat